return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'TranslatePress Multilingual','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-13T10:48:01+03:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-13T10:48:01+03:00','x-generator'=>'TranslatePress build (community + OpenRouter), 2026-10-13','messages'=>['TranslatePress - DEV'=>'TranslatePress - DEV','https://translatepress.com/'=>'https://translatepress.com/','Experience a better way of translating your WordPress site using a visual front-end translation editor, with full support for WooCommerce and site builders.'=>'使用視覺化前端翻譯編輯器翻譯你的 WordPress 網站，完整支援 WooCommerce 與網站建置工具，體驗更好的翻譯方式。','Cozmoslabs, Razvan Mocanu, Madalin Ungureanu, Cristophor Hurduban'=>'Cozmoslabs, Razvan Mocanu, Madalin Ungureanu, Cristophor Hurduban','https://cozmoslabs.com/'=>'https://cozmoslabs.com/','Active'=>'已啟用','The inactive languages will still be visible and active for the admin. For other users they won\'t be visible in the language switchers and won\'t be accessible either.'=>'非啟用中的語言對管理員仍然可見且作用中。對其他使用者而言，這些語言不會顯示在語言切換器中，也無法存取。','unknown'=>'未知','<strong>Extra Languages add-on</strong> requires TranslatePress version %1$s or higher. You are currently using version %2$s. Please update TranslatePress to enable this feature.'=>'<strong>Extra Languages 附加元件</strong>需要 TranslatePress 版本 %1$s 或更高版本。你目前使用的版本為 %2$s。請更新 TranslatePress 以啟用此功能。','Dismiss this notice.'=>'忽略此通知。','Post Slug'=>'文章 slug','URL Slugs Translation'=>'URL slug 翻譯','Slugs'=>'Slugs','Taxonomy Slugs'=>'分類法 slug','Search Taxonomy Slugs'=>'搜尋分類法 slug','Taxonomy Slug'=>'分類法 slug','Translation'=>'翻譯','Term Slugs'=>'詞彙 slug','Search Term Slugs'=>'搜尋詞彙 slug','Term Slug'=>'詞彙 slug','Taxonomy'=>'分類法','Filter by Taxonomy'=>'按分類法篩選','Post Slugs'=>'文章 slug','Search Post Slugs'=>'搜尋文章 slug','Post ID'=>'文章 ID','Post Type'=>'文章類型','Filter by Post Type'=>'依文章類型篩選','Published'=>'已發佈','Any Post Status'=>'任何文章狀態','Post Type Base Slugs'=>'文章類型基底 slug','Post Type Base Slug'=>'文章類型基底 slug','Search Post Type Base Slugs'=>'搜尋文章類型基底 slug','WooCommerce Slugs'=>'WooCommerce slug','WooCommerce Slug'=>'WooCommerce slug','Search WooCommerce Slugs'=>'搜尋 WooCommerce slug','Automatic and manual slug translation changes performed when <strong>TranslatePress - Multilingual</strong> 2.8.4 was active had to be removed because of some issues with that version. All slug translations from before that version are now in use. Thank you for understanding!'=>'由於 <strong>TranslatePress - Multilingual</strong> 2.8.4 版本存在某些問題，必須移除在該版本運作期間執行的自動和手動 slug 翻譯變更。該版本之前的所有 slug 翻譯現已恢復使用。感謝您的諒解！','If you absolutely need them, the removed translations can be found in tables trp_slug_original_obsolete and trp_slug_translation_obsolete.'=>'如果你確實需要這些翻譯，可以在 trp_slug_original_obsolete 和 trp_slug_translation_obsolete 資料表中找到。','(inactive)'=>'（未啟用）','Other Slugs'=>'其他 slug','Search Other Slugs'=>'搜尋其他 slug','Automatic User Language Detection'=>'自動偵測使用者語言','Invalid language code'=>'無效的語言代碼','We\'ve detected you might be speaking a different language. Do you want to change to:'=>'我們偵測到您可能使用不同的語言。是否要變更為：','Change Language'=>'變更語言','Close and do not switch language'=>'關閉，不要切換語言','First by browser language, then IP address (recommended)'=>'先依瀏覽器語言，再依 IP 位址（建議）','First by IP address, then by browser language'=>'先依 IP 位址，再依瀏覽器語言','Only by browser language'=>'僅依瀏覽器語言','Only by IP address'=>'僅依 IP 位址','A popup appears asking the user if they want to be redirected'=>'顯示彈出視窗詢問使用者是否想要重新導向','Redirect directly (*not recommended)'=>'直接重新導向（*不建議）','Pop-up window over the content'=>'覆蓋內容的彈出視窗','Hello bar before the content'=>'內容前的通知列','Automatic User Language Detection requires a newer version of TranslatePress to use its visual settings interface. The legacy settings form will remain available until TranslatePress is updated.'=>'「自動使用者語言偵測」需要使用較新版本的 TranslatePress 才能使用其視覺化設定介面。在 TranslatePress 更新之前，舊版設定表單將繼續可用。','Update TranslatePress'=>'更新 TranslatePress','WARNING. Cannot determine your language preference based on your current IP.<br>This is most likely because the website is on a local environment.'=>'警告：無法根據您目前的 IP 判定語言偏好。<br>這很可能是因為網站處於本機環境。','Permission denied.'=>'沒有權限。','Invalid nonce.'=>'無效的 nonce。','Invalid settings.'=>'設定無效。','Settings saved.'=>'設定已儲存。','Go to <a href="%s" target="_self">Advanced</a> tab to change this feature\'s settings'=>'前往<a href="%s" target="_self">進階</a>分頁以變更此功能的設定','Website language selector'=>'網站語言選擇器','Change language'=>'變更語言','Available languages'=>'可用語言','Please enter your DeepL API key.'=>'請輸入您的 DeepL API 金鑰。','DeepL'=>'DeepL','Bad request. There was an error accessing the DeepL API.'=>'錯誤的要求。存取 DeepL API 時發生錯誤。','The API key entered is invalid.'=>'輸入的 API 金鑰無效。','The API resource could not be found.'=>'找不到 API 資源。','The request size is too large.'=>'要求大小過大。','The request is too long.'=>'要求太長。','Too many requests. Please try again later.'=>'要求過多。請稍後再試。','Your translation quota has been reached.'=>'您的翻譯配額已達上限。','We could not process your request. Please try again later.'=>'我們無法處理您的要求。請稍後再試。','There is an error on the DeepL service and your request could not be processed.'=>'DeepL 服務發生錯誤，無法處理您的要求。','DeepL API Type'=>'DeepL API 類型','Pro'=>'專業版','Free'=>'免費','Select the type of DeepL API you want to use.'=>'選取您要使用的 DeepL API 類型。','DeepL API Key'=>'DeepL API 金鑰','Visit <a href="%s" target="_blank">this link</a> to see how you can set up an API key and control API costs.'=>'請前往<a href="%s" target="_blank">此連結</a>查看如何設定 API 金鑰並控管 API 費用。','No Active License Detected for this website.'=>'未偵測到適用於此網站的有效授權。','Enter your license key'=>'輸入你的授權金鑰',' Or %1$spurchase one here%2$s'=>' 或%1$s在此購買%2$s','Different Domain per Language'=>'每種語言使用不同網域','View Docs'=>'查看文件','Assign different domains or subdomains to each language. When visitors access these domains, TranslatePress loads the appropriate language translation directly without redirecting.'=>'為每種語言指派不同的網域或子網域。當訪客存取這些網域時，TranslatePress 會直接載入對應的語言翻譯，無需重新導向。','Example: %1$s for English, %2$s for Spanish, %3$s for French.'=>'範例：英文使用 %1$s、西班牙文使用 %2$s、法文使用 %3$s。','Before enabling:'=>'啟用前：','Ensure your domains are registered, pointed to your server, and have SSL certificates configured.'=>'請確保你的網域已註冊、指向你的伺服器，並已設定 SSL 憑證。','Domain'=>'網域','Map this language to a different domain or sub-domain.'=>'將此語言對應至不同的網域或子網域。','https://example.com'=>'https://example.com','Prefill with current domain'=>'以目前網域預填','Check DNS'=>'檢查 DNS','Checking DNS...'=>'正在檢查 DNS…','DNS is correctly configured!'=>'DNS 設定正確！','DNS check failed. Please verify your domain configuration.'=>'DNS 檢查失敗。請確認你的網域設定。','This domain is already assigned to another language.'=>'此網域已指派給其他語言。','<strong>Different Domain per Language add-on</strong> requires TranslatePress version %1$s or higher. You are currently using version %2$s. Please update TranslatePress to enable this feature.'=>'<strong>Different Domain per Language 附加元件</strong>需要 TranslatePress 版本 %1$s 或更高版本。你目前使用的版本為 %2$s。請更新 TranslatePress 以啟用此功能。','Note: This option is disabled when Different Domain for Language addon is active.'=>'注意：當 Different Domain for Language 附加元件啟用時，此選項會停用。','Different Domain per Language: Domain is required when domain mapping is enabled. The toggle has been disabled for languages with empty domains.'=>'Different Domain per Language：啟用網域對應時必須提供網域。已停用網域為空之語言的切換開關。','Different Domain per Language: The same domain cannot be assigned to multiple languages. The toggle has been disabled for duplicate domains.'=>'Different Domain per Language：同一個網域無法指派給多個語言。已停用重複網域的切換開關。','Different Domain per Language: A language domain cannot be the same as the main site URL. The toggle has been disabled for the matching domain.'=>'Different Domain per Language：語言網域不能與主要網站 URL 相同。已停用相符網域的切換開關。','Please enter a domain.'=>'請輸入網域。','Invalid domain format.'=>'網域格式無效。','Could not reach domain: %s'=>'無法連線至網域：%s','Domain is reachable!'=>'網域可以連線！','Domain returned HTTP status %d.'=>'網域傳回 HTTP 狀態碼 %d。','Limit this menu item to the following languages'=>'將此選單項目限制為以下語言','All Languages'=>'所有語言','Translator'=>'譯者',' TranslatePress Settings'=>' TranslatePress 設定','Allow this user to translate the website.'=>'允許這位使用者翻譯網站。','Translate Site'=>'翻譯網站','Add-On'=>'附加元件','Deactivate'=>'停用','Activate'=>'啟用','Installing...'=>'安裝中…','This add-on can not be activated back without a valid license. Are you sure you want to deactivate it?'=>'沒有有效授權就無法重新啟用這個附加元件。你確定要停用嗎？','Documentation'=>'說明文件','A valid license is required to activate add-ons.'=>'啟用附加元件需要有效授權。','Activate all'=>'全部啟用','Add-ons can not be activated back without a valid license. Are you sure you want to deactivate them?'=>'沒有有效授權就無法重新啟用附加元件。你確定要將它們停用嗎？','Deactivate all'=>'全部停用','%1$sAdd-ons settings saved successfully%2$s'=>'%1$s附加元件設定已成功儲存%2$s','Date format'=>'日期格式','Customize the date formatting per each translated language.<br/>Leave empty for default WP setting or see more information <a href="https://wordpress.org/support/article/formatting-date-and-time/" title="Formatting Date and Time" target="_blank">here</a>'=>'為每個翻譯語言自訂日期格式。<br/>留空以使用預設 WP 設定，或<a href="https://wordpress.org/support/article/formatting-date-and-time/" title="Formatting Date and Time" target="_blank">在此處</a>查看更多資訊。','To edit an existing TranslatePress language, input the language code and fill in only the columns you want to overwrite (e.g. Language name, Flag).<br>You can also add new custom languages. They will be available under General settings, All Languages list, where the URL slug can be edited.'=>'若要編輯現有的 TranslatePress 語言，請輸入語言代碼，並僅填寫您想要覆寫的欄位（例如語言名稱、旗標）。<br>您也可以新增自訂語言。這些語言將會顯示在「一般設定」的「所有語言」清單中，您可以在該處編輯 URL slug。','For custom flag, first upload the image in media library then paste the URL.<br>Changing or deleting a custom language will impact translations and site URL\'s.<br>The Language code and the ISO Code should contain only alphabetical values, numerical values, "-" and "_".<br>The ISO Codes can be found on <a href = "https://cloud.google.com/translate/docs/languages" target = "_blank">Google ISO Codes</a> and <a href = "https://www.deepl.com/docs-api/translating-text/" target = "_blank">DeepL Target Codes</a>.'=>'若要使用自訂旗標，請先將圖片上傳至媒體庫，然後貼上 URL。<br>變更或刪除自訂語言將會影響翻譯和網站 URL。<br>語言代碼和 ISO 代碼只能包含字母、數字、「-」和「_」。<br>ISO 代碼可於 <a href = "https://cloud.google.com/translate/docs/languages" target = "_blank">Google ISO 代碼</a> 和 <a href = "https://www.deepl.com/docs-api/translating-text/" target = "_blank">DeepL 目標代碼</a> 查詢。','Language code'=>'語言代碼','Language name'=>'語言名稱','Native name'=>'原生名稱','ISO Code'=>'ISO 代碼','Flag URL'=>'旗標 URL','Text RTL'=>'RTL 文字','Custom language'=>'自訂語言','Disable bundled plugin translations'=>'停用隨附的外掛翻譯','By default, TranslatePress ships its own translation files in <code>wp-content/plugins/translatepress/languages/</code> and forces WordPress to use them instead of the language packs installed automatically from translate.wordpress.org.<br/>Enable this option to disable that override. WordPress will then load the community language pack from <code>wp-content/languages/plugins/</code> (if present) and fall back to the bundled files only when no pack is available.'=>'預設情況下，TranslatePress 會將自己的翻譯檔案放在 <code>wp-content/plugins/translatepress/languages/</code>，並強制 WordPress 使用這些檔案，而非自動從 translate.wordpress.org 安裝的語言套件。<br/>啟用此選項可停用該覆寫行為。WordPress 將會改為從 <code>wp-content/languages/plugins/</code> 載入社群語言套件（若存在的話），並且只在沒有可用套件時才會回退到隨附的檔案。','Disable dynamic translation'=>'停用動態翻譯','It disables detection of strings displayed dynamically using JavaScript. <br/>Strings loaded via a server side AJAX call will still be translated.'=>'停用偵測使用 JavaScript 動態顯示的字串。 <br/>透過伺服器端 AJAX 呼叫載入的字串仍會被翻譯。','Disable translation for gettext strings'=>'停用 gettext 字串的翻譯','Gettext Strings are strings outputted by themes and plugins. <br> Translating these types of strings through TranslatePress can be unnecessary if they are already translated using the .po/.mo translation file system.<br>Enabling this option can improve the page load performance of your site in certain cases. The disadvantage is that you can no longer edit gettext translations using TranslatePress, nor benefit from automatic translation on these strings.'=>'Gettext 字串是由佈景主題和外掛輸出的字串。<br> 如果這類字串已經使用 .po/.mo 翻譯檔案系統完成翻譯，透過 TranslatePress 再次翻譯可能是不必要的。<br>啟用此選項在某些情況下可改善網站的頁面載入效能。缺點是您將無法再使用 TranslatePress 編輯 gettext 翻譯，這些字串也無法使用自動翻譯。','Gettext Strings translation is disabled'=>'Gettext 字串翻譯已停用','To enable it go to '=>'若要啟用，請前往 ','TranslatePress->Advanced Settings->Debug->Disable translation for gettext strings'=>'TranslatePress->進階設定->偵錯->停用 Gettext 字串翻譯',' and uncheck the Checkbox.'=>' 並取消勾選核取方塊。','Dismiss'=>'關閉','Exclude translated links from sitemap'=>'從 sitemap 排除翻譯連結','Do not include translated links in sitemaps generated by SEO plugins.<br/>Requires <a href="https://translatepress.com/docs/addons/seo-pack/?utm_source=tp-advanced&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=miscellaneous" title="TranslatePress Add-on SEO Pack documentation" target="_blank"> SEO Pack Add-on</a> to be installed and activated.'=>'請勿將翻譯後的連結包含在 SEO 外掛產生的 sitemaps 中。<br/>需要安裝並啟用<a href="https://translatepress.com/docs/addons/seo-pack/?utm_source=tp-advanced&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=miscellaneous" title="TranslatePress Add-on SEO Pack documentation" target="_blank"> SEO Pack 附加元件</a>。','Disable post container tags for post title'=>'停用文章標題的容器標籤','It disables search indexing the post title in translated languages.<br/>Useful when the title of the post doesn\'t allow HTML thus breaking the page.'=>'這會停用翻譯語言中文章標題的搜尋索引。<br/>當文章標題不允許 HTML 因而導致頁面損壞時，此功能非常實用。','Disable post container tags for post content'=>'停用文章內容的容器標籤','It disables search indexing the post content in translated languages.<br/>Useful when the content of the post doesn\'t allow HTML thus breaking the page.'=>'這會停用翻譯語言中文章內容的搜尋索引。<br/>當文章內容不允許 HTML 因而導致頁面損壞時，此功能非常實用。','Do not translate certain paths'=>'不翻譯特定路徑','Choose what paths can be translated. Supports wildcard at the end of the path.<br>For example, to exclude https://example.com/some/path you can either use the rule /some/path/ or /some/*.<br>Enter each rule on it\'s own line. To exclude the home page use {{home}}.'=>'選擇哪些路徑可以翻譯。支援在路徑結尾使用萬用字元。<br>例如，要排除 https://example.com/some/path，你可以使用規則 /some/path/ 或 /some/*。<br>每條規則請輸入於獨立一行。若要排除首頁，請使用 {home}。','Exclude Paths From Translation'=>'從翻譯排除路徑','Translate Only Certain Paths'=>'只翻譯特定路徑','Enable the hreflang x-default tag for language:'=>'啟用語言的 hreflang x-default 標籤：','Enables the hreflang="x-default" for an entire language. See documentation for more details.'=>'為整個語言啟用 hreflang="x-default"。詳情請參閱說明文件。','Translate numbers and numerals'=>'翻譯數字與數值','Enable translation of numbers ( e.g. phone numbers)'=>'啟用數字翻譯（例如電話號碼）','Selector'=>'選取器','Exclude from dynamic translation'=>'從動態翻譯排除','Do not dynamically translate strings that are found in html nodes matching these selectors.<br>Excludes all the children of HTML nodes matching these selectors from being translated using JavaScript.<br/>These strings will still be translated on the server side if possible.'=>'不要動態翻譯在符合這些選取器的 HTML 節點中找到的字串。<br>排除符合這些選取器之 HTML 節點的所有子節點，使其不會透過 JavaScript 進行翻譯。<br/>如果可行，這些字串仍會在伺服器端進行翻譯。','Gettext String'=>'Gettext 字串','Exclude Gettext Strings'=>'排除 Gettext 字串','Exclude these strings from being translated as Gettext strings by TranslatePress. Leave the domain empty to take into account any Gettext string.<br/>Can still be translated through po/mo files.'=>'將這些字串排除在 TranslatePress 的 Gettext 字串翻譯之外。將網域留白以納入任何 Gettext 字串。<br/>仍可透過 po/mo 檔案進行翻譯。','Exclude selectors only from automatic translation'=>'僅將選擇器排除於自動翻譯之外','Do not automatically translate strings that are found in html nodes matching these selectors.<br>Excludes all the children of HTML nodes matching these selectors from being automatically translated.<br>Manual translation of these strings is still possible.'=>'不要自動翻譯在符合這些選取器的 HTML 節點中找到的字串。<br>排除符合這些選取器之 HTML 節點的所有子節點，使其不會自動翻譯。<br>這些字串仍可以手動翻譯。','Exclude selectors from translation'=>'將選擇器排除於翻譯之外','Do not translate strings that are found in html nodes matching these selectors.<br>Excludes all the children of HTML nodes matching these selectors from being translated.<br>These strings cannot be translated manually nor automatically.'=>'不要翻譯在符合這些選取器的 HTML 節點中找到的字串。<br>排除符合這些選取器之 HTML 節點的所有子節點，使其不被翻譯。<br>這些字串無法手動或自動翻譯。','String'=>'字串','Exclude strings from automatic translation'=>'將字串排除在自動翻譯之外','Do not automatically translate these strings (ex. names, technical words...)<br>Paragraphs containing these strings will still be translated except for the specified part.'=>'不要自動翻譯這些字串（例如名稱、技術詞彙……）。<br>包含這些字串的段落仍會翻譯，但指定的部分除外。','Fix broken HTML'=>'修復損壞的 HTML','General attempt to fix broken or missing HTML on translated pages.<br/>'=>'一般嘗試修復翻譯頁面上損壞或遺漏的 HTML。<br/>','Force slash at end of home url:'=>'強制在首頁 URL 結尾加上斜線：','Ads a slash at the end of the home_url() function'=>'在 home_url() 函式結尾加上斜線','Show Both (recommended)'=>'兩者都顯示（建議）','Remove Country Locale'=>'移除國家/地區語系','Remove Region Independent Locale'=>'移除區域獨立語系','Remove duplicate hreflang'=>'移除重複的 hreflang','Choose which hreflang tags will appear on your website.<br/>We recommend showing both types of hreflang tags as indicated by <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/advanced/crawling/localized-versions" title="Google Crawling" target="_blank">Google documentation</a>.<br/>Removing Country Locale when having multiple Country Locales of the same language (ex. English UK and English US) will result in showing one hreflang tag with link to just one of the region locales for that language.'=>'選擇哪些 hreflang 標籤會顯示在您的網站上。<br/>我們建議顯示這兩種 hreflang 標籤，如<a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/advanced/crawling/localized-versions" title="Google Crawling" target="_blank">Google 說明文件</a>所述。<br/>當同一語言有多個國家/地區語系（例如：英文（英國）與英文（美國））時，移除國家/地區語系將導致只顯示一個 hreflang 標籤，且連結僅指向該語言的其中一個地區語系。','Default (example: en-US, fr-CA, etc.)'=>'預設（例如：en-US、fr-CA 等）','Regional (example: en, fr, es, etc.)'=>'區域（例如：en、fr、es 等）','HTML Lang Attribute Format'=>'HTML Lang 屬性格式','Change lang attribute of the html tag to a format that includes country regional or not. <br>In HTML, the lang attribute (<html lang="en-US">)  should be used to  specify the language of text content so that the  browser can correctly display or process  your content (eg. for  hyphenation, styling, spell checking, etc).'=>'將 html 標籤的 lang 屬性變更為包含或不包含國家/地區的格式。<br>在 HTML 中，lang 屬性（<html lang="en-US">）應用於指定文字內容的語言，以便瀏覽器能正確顯示或處理您的內容（例如斷字、樣式設定、拼字檢查等）。','Load legacy Language Switcher'=>'載入舊版語言切換器','Applies to all types of language switchers (floating, shortcode, and menu). When enabled, the site will revert to using the original Language Switcher configured in the General Settings tab, replacing the new customizable version. Your existing switcher settings will remain saved, but they will be ignored while this option is active.'=>'適用於所有類型的語言切換器（浮動、shortcode 和選單）。啟用後，網站將恢復使用「一般設定」分頁中設定的原始語言切換器，取代新的可自訂版本。您現有的切換器設定將繼續儲存，但在此選項啟用期間會被忽略。','Load legacy SEO Pack Add-On'=>'載入舊版 SEO Pack 附加元件','In case the recent migration to the new slug rewrite is causing trouble, set this to Yes to use the old method <br> Please <a href="https://translatepress.com/support/open-ticket/?utm_source=tp-advanced&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=troubleshooting" target="_blank">open a support ticket</a> letting us know of the issues you are having.'=>'如果最近移轉至新的 slug 重寫規則造成問題，請將此選項設為「是」以使用舊方法 <br> 請<a href="https://translatepress.com/support/open-ticket/?utm_source=tp-advanced&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=troubleshooting" target="_blank">開啟支援票證</a>，讓我們知道您遇到的問題。','Manual Translation Only'=>'僅手動翻譯','TranslatePress pro-actively scans and saves strings in the database when users access translated pages. <br>This setting disables this functionality and only allows translation and string saving when inside the Translation Editor. <br>Also disables machine translation outside the Translation Editor, giving you better control over character spending, by translating only the pages you visit in the Translation Editor.'=>'TranslatePress 會在使用者存取翻譯頁面時，主動掃描並將字串儲存至資料庫。<br>此設定會停用這項功能，僅允許在翻譯編輯器內進行翻譯和儲存字串。<br>同時也會停用翻譯編輯器外部的機器翻譯，只翻譯您在翻譯編輯器中瀏覽的頁面，讓您更能控制字元用量。','Open language switcher only on click'=>'僅在點擊時開啟語言切換器','Open the language switcher shortcode by clicking on it instead of hovering.<br> Close it by clicking on it, anywhere else on the screen or by pressing the escape key. This will affect only the shortcode language switcher.'=>'透過點擊而非懸停來開啟語言切換器 shortcode。<br> 點擊該元素、畫面其他位置，或按下 Esc 鍵即可關閉。這只會影響 shortcode 語言切換器。','Show opposite language in the language switcher'=>'在語言切換器中顯示另一種語言','Transforms the language switcher into a button showing the other available language, not the current one.<br> Only works when there are exactly two languages, the default one and a translation one.<br>This will affect the shortcode language switcher and floating language switcher as well.<br> To achieve this in menu language switcher go to Appearance->Menus->Language Switcher and select Opposite Language.'=>'將語言切換器變更為顯示另一個可用語言（而非目前語言）的按鈕。<br> 僅在恰好有兩種語言（預設語言和翻譯語言）時有效。<br>這也會影響 shortcode 語言切換器和浮動語言切換器。<br> 若要在選單語言切換器中達成此效果，請前往「外觀->選單->語言切換器」並選取「另一種語言」。','TranslatePress gettext database optimization failed.'=>'TranslatePress Gettext 資料庫最佳化失敗。','Retry'=>'重試','TranslatePress needs to optimize its gettext database tables. Back up the database, then <a href="%s">start the optimization</a>.'=>'TranslatePress 需要最佳化其 Gettext 資料庫資料表。請先備份資料庫，然後<a href="%s">開始最佳化</a>。','Pending gettext database optimization'=>'Gettext 資料庫最佳化待處理','Optimize TranslatePress database tables'=>'最佳化 TranslatePress 資料庫資料表','<a href="%s">Click here</a> to access the database optimization tool.'=>'<a href="%s">點擊這裡</a>以存取資料庫最佳化工具。','It helps remove possible duplicate translations, clear unnecessary data and repair possible metadata issues.'=>'可協助移除可能的重複翻譯、清除不必要的資料，並修復可能的中繼資料問題。','<a href="%s" target="_blank">Here</a> you can observe the last 5 SQL errors relevant to TranslatePress if they exist.'=>'<a href="%s" target="_blank">這裡</a>可以查看與 TranslatePress 相關的最後 5 筆 SQL 錯誤（如果存在的話）。','Troubleshooting'=>'疑難排解','Exclude Gettext strings'=>'排除 Gettext 字串','Debug'=>'偵錯','Custom languages'=>'自訂語言','Miscellaneous options'=>'其他選項','Language Switcher'=>'語言切換器','Exclude strings & pages'=>'排除字串與頁面','Automatic Translation Memory'=>'自動翻譯記憶體','Serve same translation for similar text. The strings need to have a percentage of 95% similarity.<br>Helps prevent losing existing translation when correcting typos or making minor adjustments to the original text. <br>If a translation already exists for a very similar original string, it will automatically be used for the current original string.<br>Does not work when making changes to a text that is part of a translation block unless the new text is manually merged again in a translation block.<br>Each string needs to have a minimum of 50 characters.'=>'為相似文字提供相同翻譯。字串必須達到 95% 的相似度。<br>有助於在修正錯字或對原始文字進行微調時，避免遺失現有翻譯。 <br>若已有與目前原始字串非常相似的字串翻譯，將自動套用到目前的原始字串。<br>當修改屬於翻譯區塊一部分的文字時，此功能不會生效，除非新文字再次手動合併到翻譯區塊中。<br>每個字串必須至少包含 50 個字元。','WARNING: This feature can negatively impact page loading times in secondary languages, particularly with large databases (for example websites with a lot of pages or products). If you experience slow loading times, disable this and try again.'=>'警告：此功能可能會對次要語言的頁面載入時間造成負面影響，特別是在資料庫龐大的情況下（例如擁有大量頁面或商品的網站）。如果您遇到載入速度變慢的情況，請停用此功能後再試一次。','Fix missing dynamic content'=>'修正遺失的動態內容','May help fix missing content inserted using JavaScript. <br> It shows dynamically inserted content in original language for a moment before the translation request is finished.'=>'可能有助於修正使用 JavaScript 插入的遺失內容。<br> 在翻譯請求完成前，會短暫顯示以原始語言動態插入的內容。','Filter Gettext wrapping from post content and title'=>'過濾文章內容與標題中的 Gettext 包裝標記','Filters gettext wrapping such as #!trpst#trp-gettext from all updated post content and post title. Does not affect previous post content. <br/><strong>Database backup is recommended before switching on.</strong>'=>'過濾所有已更新文章內容及標題中的 Gettext 包裝標記（例如 #!trpst#trp-gettext）。不會影響先前的文章內容。 <br/><strong>建議在開啟前先備份資料庫。</strong>','Filter Gettext wrapping from post meta'=>'過濾文章中繼資料中的 Gettext 包裝標記','Filters gettext wrapping such as #!trpst#trp-gettext from all updated post meta. Does not affect previous post meta. <br/><strong>Database backup is recommended before switching on.</strong>'=>'過濾所有已更新文章中繼資料中的 Gettext 包裝標記（例如 #!trpst#trp-gettext）。不會影響先前的文章中繼資料。 <br/><strong>建議在開啟前先備份資料庫。</strong>','TranslatePress'=>'TranslatePress','Abilities for managing TranslatePress configuration.'=>'管理 TranslatePress 設定的權限','Add a translation language'=>'新增翻譯語言','Adds a translation language to TranslatePress. Enforces the same per-license limit as the settings UI.'=>'為 TranslatePress 新增翻譯語言。強制執行與設定介面相同的每份授權限制。','WordPress locale code (e.g. fr_FR, de_DE).'=>'WordPress 語系代碼（例如 fr_FR、de_DE）。','Optional URL slug. Defaults to the ISO language code if omitted.'=>'選填的 URL slug。若省略，預設為 ISO 語言代碼。','Set TranslatePress license key'=>'設定 TranslatePress 授權金鑰','Saves a TranslatePress license key and triggers a remote license check, mirroring the onboarding flow.'=>'儲存 TranslatePress 授權金鑰並觸發遠端授權檢查，與新手引導流程一致。','The license key to activate.'=>'要啟用的授權金鑰。','Enable Automatic Translation'=>'啟用自動翻譯','Turns on Automatic Translation. A valid TranslatePress license is required only when the resolved engine is TranslatePress AI (mtapi); Google Translate and DeepL do not require one. If no engine is passed and none is configured, defaults to mtapi.'=>'開啟自動翻譯。只有當實際使用的引擎為 TranslatePress AI (mtapi) 時，才需要有效的 TranslatePress 授權；Google Translate 和 DeepL 則不需要。如果未傳入引擎且未設定任何引擎，則預設為 mtapi。','Optional translation-engine slug to select (e.g. "mtapi", "google_translate_v2", "deepl"). When omitted, keeps the already-configured engine, or defaults to "mtapi" if none is configured.'=>'可選用的翻譯引擎 slug（例如 "mtapi"、"google_translate_v2"、"deepl"）。若省略，則保留已設定的引擎；若未設定任何引擎，則預設為 "mtapi"。','List configured languages'=>'列出已設定的語言','Returns the languages currently configured in TranslatePress, including the default language and per-language slug/publish state.'=>'傳回目前設定在 TranslatePress 中的語言，包含預設語言以及各語言的 slug/發布狀態。','List available language codes'=>'列出可用的語言代碼','Returns the full catalog of language codes TranslatePress recognizes, with their English names.'=>'傳回 TranslatePress 可識別的完整語言代碼目錄，及其英文名稱。','Remove a translation language'=>'移除翻譯語言','Removes a configured translation language. The default language cannot be removed without first reassigning the default.'=>'移除已設定的翻譯語言。預設語言必須先重新指派後才能移除。','Locale code of the language to remove.'=>'要移除的語言的地區代碼。','Update a translation language'=>'更新翻譯語言','Replaces the slug and publish status of an already-configured translation language.'=>'取代已設定之翻譯語言的 slug 和發布狀態。','Locale code of the language to update.'=>'要更新的語言的地區代碼。','URL slug for this language.'=>'此語言的 URL slug。','Whether this language is published on the front end.'=>'此語言是否在前端發布。','Set the default language'=>'設定預設語言','Promotes an already-configured language to be the site default. The previous default remains in the translation languages list.'=>'將已設定的語言提升為網站預設語言。先前的預設語言會保留在翻譯語言清單中。','Locale code to promote to default. Must already be a configured translation language.'=>'要提升為預設語言的地區代碼。必須已是設定的翻譯語言。','You do not have permission to manage TranslatePress settings.'=>'你沒有管理 TranslatePress 設定的權限。','Invalid language code. Allowed characters: A-Z, a-z, 0-9, hyphen, underscore.'=>'語言代碼無效。允許的字元：A-Z、a-z、0-9、連字號、底線。','Language code "%s" is not recognized by TranslatePress.'=>'TranslatePress 無法識別語言代碼「%s」。','Language "%s" is already configured.'=>'語言「%s」已設定完成。','Your current license allows up to %d additional language(s). Upgrade or activate a Pro license to add more.'=>'您目前的授權最多允許 %d 個額外語言。升級或啟用 Pro 授權以新增更多語言。','TranslatePress rejected the new language during settings sanitization.'=>'TranslatePress 在設定清理過程中拒絕了這個新語言。','Enabling Automatic Translation with the TranslatePress AI engine requires an active TranslatePress license. Activate a license first with translatepress/set-license-key, or pass a different engine (e.g. "google_translate_v2", "deepl").'=>'使用 TranslatePress AI 引擎開啟自動翻譯需要有效的 TranslatePress 授權。請先使用 translatepress/set-license-key 啟用授權，或傳入其他引擎（例如 "google_translate_v2"、"deepl"）。','Your license key expired on %s.'=>'您的授權金鑰已於 %s 過期。','Your license key has expired.'=>'您的授權金鑰已過期。','Your license key has been disabled.'=>'您的授權金鑰已被停用。','Your TranslatePress license key is invalid or missing.'=>'您的 TranslatePress 授權金鑰無效或遺失。','Your license key is disabled for this URL. Re-enable it from your TranslatePress account.'=>'您的授權金鑰已在此 URL 停用。請從您的 TranslatePress 帳戶重新啟用。','License key mismatch. The license you entered does not match the TranslatePress version you have installed.'=>'授權金鑰不符。您輸入的授權與已安裝的 TranslatePress 版本不相符。','Your license key has reached its activation limit.'=>'您的授權金鑰已達啟用上限。','An error occurred while activating the license, please try again.'=>'啟用授權時發生錯誤，請再試一次。','Language "%s" is not currently configured.'=>'語言「%s」目前尚未設定。','The default language cannot be removed. Set another language as default first.'=>'無法移除預設語言。請先將其他語言設為預設。','Slug is empty after sanitization. Use only URL-safe characters.'=>'slug 在清理後為空白。請只使用安全的 URL 字元。','Language "%s" is not currently configured. Add it first with translatepress/add-language.'=>'語言「%s」目前尚未設定。請先使用 translatepress/add-language 新增。','The default language is always published and cannot be unpublished.'=>'預設語言一律會發布，且無法取消發布。','Slug "%1$s" is already in use by language "%2$s".'=>'slug「%1$s」已被語言「%2$s」使用。','TranslatePress rejected the new settings during sanitization.'=>'TranslatePress 在清理過程中拒絕了新設定。','Advanced'=>'進階','Are you sure you want to remove this item?'=>'確定要移除此項目嗎？','Remove'=>'移除','Add'=>'新增','Select...'=>'選取...','An error occurred, please try again.'=>'發生錯誤，請再試一次。','Your license key is disabled for this URL. Re-enable it from <a target="_blank" href="https://translatepress.com/account/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=license-deactivated">https://translatepress.com/account</a> -> Manage Sites.'=>'您的授權金鑰已在此 URL 停用。請從 <a target="_blank" href="https://translatepress.com/account/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=license-deactivated">https://translatepress.com/account</a> -> 管理網站重新啟用。','<p><strong>License key mismatch.</strong> The license you entered doesn’t match the TranslatePress version you have installed.</p><p>Please check that you’ve installed the correct version for your license from your TranslatePress account.</p>'=>'<p><strong>授權金鑰不符。</strong>您輸入的授權與已安裝的 TranslatePress 版本不符。</p><p>請確認您已從 TranslatePress 帳號安裝與授權相符的正確版本。</p>','If you have only the free plugin installed but added a paid license, please install the paid plugin from your TranslatePress account.'=>'如果您只安裝了免費外掛，但已新增付費授權，請從您的 TranslatePress 帳號安裝付費外掛。','Upgrade your plan to add more sites. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s'=>'升級您的方案以新增更多網站。%1$s立即升級%2$s','You have successfully activated your license'=>'您已成功啟用授權。','[%s] Low TranslatePress AI Words'=>'[%s] TranslatePress AI 字數不足','upgrade your plan'=>'升級您的方案','upgrade your plan or get extra AI Words'=>'升級您的方案或取得額外 AI 字數','TranslatePress AI words are running low on your site.'=>'您網站上的 TranslatePress AI 字數即將用完。','Current status: %s words remaining'=>'目前狀態：剩餘 %s 字','Once the remaining AI words run out, automatic translation through TranslatePress AI will be paused.'=>'一旦剩餘 AI 字數用完，透過 TranslatePress AI 進行的自動翻譯將會暫停。','To continue translating your content, please %1$s over at %2$s'=>'若要繼續翻譯您的內容，請前往 %2$s %1$s','Manage Notification: %s'=>'管理通知：%s','Others'=>'其他','Restrict by Language'=>'依語言限制','Exclude from Language'=>'從語言排除','Restrict element to language'=>'限制元素顯示語言','Show this element only in one language.'=>'僅在單一語言中顯示此元素。','Enable translation'=>'啟用翻譯','Allow translation to the corresponding language only if the content is written in the default language.'=>'僅當內容以預設語言撰寫時，才允許翻譯為對應語言。','Select language'=>'選取語言','Choose in which language to show this element.'=>'選擇要以哪種語言顯示此元素。','Exclude element from language'=>'從語言排除元素','Exclude this element from specific languages.'=>'從特定語言排除此元素。','Select languages'=>'選取語言','Choose from which languages to exclude this element.'=>'選擇要從哪些語言排除此元素。','This element will still be visible when you are translating your website through the Translation Editor.'=>'透過翻譯編輯器翻譯網站時，此元素仍會顯示。','The content of this element should be written in the default language.'=>'此元素的內容應以預設語言撰寫。','<strong>TranslatePress</strong> encountered SQL errors. <a href="%s" title="View TranslatePress SQL Errors">Check out the errors</a>.'=>'<strong>TranslatePress</strong> 遇到 SQL 錯誤。<a href="%s" title="View TranslatePress SQL Errors">查看錯誤</a>。','Automatic translation has been disabled.'=>'自動翻譯已停用。','Logged errors'=>'已記錄的錯誤','These are the most recent 5 errors logged by TranslatePress:'=>'以下是 TranslatePress 記錄的最新的 5 個錯誤：','Yes'=>'是','Why are these errors occuring'=>'為什麼會發生這些錯誤','If TranslatePress detects something wrong when executing queries on your database, it may disable the Automatic Translation feature in order to avoid any extra charging by Google/DeepL. Automatic Translation needs to be manually turned on, after you solve the issues.'=>'如果 TranslatePress 在執行資料庫查詢時偵測到異常，可能會停用自動翻譯功能，以避免 Google/DeepL 額外收費。解決問題後，需要手動重新開啟自動翻譯。','The SQL errors detected can occur for various reasons including missing tables, missing permissions for the SQL user to create tables or perform other operations, problems after site migration or changes to SQL server configuration.'=>'偵測到的 SQL 錯誤可能由多種原因造成，包括缺少資料表、SQL 使用者缺少建立資料表或執行其他操作的權限、網站遷移後的問題，或是 SQL 伺服器設定變更。','What you can do in this situation'=>'您可以在此情況下怎麼做','Plan A.'=>'方案 A.','Go to Settings -> TranslatePress -> General tab and Save Settings. This will regenerate the tables using your current SQL settings. Check if no more errors occur while browsing your website in a translated language. Look at the timestamps of the errors to make sure you are not seeing the old errors. Only the most recent 5 errors are displayed.'=>'前往「設定」->「TranslatePress」->「一般」分頁，然後儲存設定。這會使用您目前的 SQL 設定重新產生資料表。請以翻譯語言瀏覽網站，確認是否不再發生錯誤。請查看錯誤時間戳記，以確保您看到的不是舊錯誤。只會顯示最近 5 筆錯誤。','Plan B.'=>'方案 B.','If your problem isn\'t solved, try the following steps:'=>'如果問題尚未解決，請嘗試以下步驟：','Create a backup of your database'=>'建立資料庫備份','Create a copy of each translation table where you encounter errors. You can copy the table within the same database (trp_dictionary_en_us_es_es_COPY for example) -- perform this step only if you want to keep the current translations'=>'為每個發生錯誤的翻譯資料表建立副本。您可以在同一個資料庫內複製資料表（例如 trp_dictionary_en_us_es_es_COPY）——只有當您想保留目前翻譯時，才執行此步驟。','Remove the trouble tables by executing the DROP function on them'=>'執行 DROP 函式來移除有問題的資料表','Go to Settings -> TranslatePress -> General tab and Save Settings. This will regenerate the tables using your current SQL server.'=>'前往「設定」->「TranslatePress」->「一般」分頁，然後儲存設定。這會使用您目前的 SQL 伺服器重新產生資料表。','Copy the relevant content from the duplicated tables (trp_dictionary_en_us_es_es_COPY for example) in the newly generated table (trp_dictionary_en_us_es_es) -- perform this step only if you want to keep the current translations'=>'將複製資料表中的相關內容（例如 trp_dictionary_en_us_es_es_COPY）複製到新產生的資料表（trp_dictionary_en_us_es_es）中——只有當您想保留目前翻譯時，才執行此步驟。','Test it to see if everything is working. If something went wrong, you can restore the backup that you\'ve made at the first step. Check if no more errors occur while browsing your website in a translated language. Look at the timestamps of the errors to make sure you are not seeing the old errors. Only the most recent 5 errors are displayed.'=>'進行測試以確認一切正常。如果發生問題，您可以還原第一步建立的備份。請以翻譯語言瀏覽網站，確認是否不再發生錯誤。請查看錯誤時間戳記，以確保您看到的不是舊錯誤。只會顯示最近 5 筆錯誤。','Plan C.'=>'方案 C.','If your problem still isn\'t solved, try asking your hosting about your errors. The most common issue is missing permissions for the SQL user, such as the Create Tables permission.'=>'如果問題仍未解決，請嘗試向您的主機商詢問這些錯誤。最常見的問題是 SQL 使用者缺少權限，例如建立資料表的權限。','Could not install. Try again from <a href="%s" >Plugins Dashboard.</a>'=>'無法安裝。請從<a href="%s" >外掛程式頁面</a>再試一次。','Settings scope unknown.'=>'設定範圍未知。','Legacy disabled.'=>'舊版功能已停用。','Change language to %s'=>'將語言變更為 %s','Automatic Translation'=>'自動翻譯','Unsupported languages'=>'不支援的語言','The selected automatic translation engine does not provide support for these languages.<br>You can still manually translate pages in these languages using the Translation Editor.'=>'選取的自動翻譯引擎不支援這些語言。<br>您仍可使用翻譯編輯器手動翻譯這些語言的頁面。','General'=>'一般','Glossary'=>'詞彙表','API key validation failed.'=>'API 金鑰驗證失敗。','API key verification was successful.'=>'API 金鑰驗證成功。','Please enter your Google Translate key.'=>'請輸入您的 Google Translate 金鑰。','Not TranslatePress onboarding page.'=>'非 TranslatePress 設定引導頁面。','Step %s does not exist'=>'步驟 %s 不存在','Welcome'=>'歡迎','Add Languages'=>'新增語言','Enable Addons'=>'啟用附加元件','Finalize'=>'完成','Exit Setup'=>'退出設定','Upgrade'=>'升級','Nothing here'=>'尚無內容','Your <strong>TranslatePress</strong> license is missing or invalid. <br/>Please %1$sregister your copy%2$s to enable automatic website translation via TranslatePress AI, premium addons, automatic updates and support. Need a license key? %3$sPurchase one now%4$s'=>'您的 <strong>TranslatePress</strong> 授權遺失或無效。<br/>請 %1$s註冊您的副本%2$s，以啟用透過 TranslatePress AI 提供的自動網站翻譯、進階附加元件、自動更新及支援服務。需要授權金鑰嗎？%3$s立即購買%4$s','Your license is disabled for this URL. Re-enable it from <a target="_blank" href="https://translatepress.com/account/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=license-deactivated">https://translatepress.com/account</a> -> Manage Sites.'=>'您的授權已在此 URL 停用。請前往 <a target="_blank" href="https://translatepress.com/account/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=license-deactivated">https://translatepress.com/account</a> -> 管理網站 重新啟用。','You have reached the activation limit for your <strong>%1$s</strong> license. <br/>Manage your active sites from %2$s your account %3$s.'=>'您的 <strong>%1$s</strong> 授權已達啟用數量上限。<br/>從 %2$s 您的帳號 %3$s 管理已啟用的網站。','License key mismatch. The license you entered doesn’t match the <strong>%1$s</strong> version you have installed. <br/>Please check that you’ve installed the correct version for your license from your %2$sTranslatePress account%3$s.'=>'授權金鑰不符。您輸入的授權與您已安裝的 <strong>%1$s</strong> 版本不相符。<br/>請在您的 %2$sTranslatePress Account%3$s 中確認您已安裝與授權相符的正確版本。','<br/>If you have only the free plugin installed but added a paid license, please install the paid plugin from your TranslatePress account.'=>'<br/>如果您只安裝了免費版外掛，但新增了付費授權，請從您的 TranslatePress Account 安裝付費版外掛。','Your <strong>TranslatePress</strong> license has expired. <br/>Please %1$sRenew Your Licence%2$s to continue receiving access to automatic translations via TranslatePress AI, premium addons, product downloads, and automatic updates. %3$sRenew now %4$s'=>'您的 <strong>TranslatePress</strong> 授權已到期。<br/>請 %1$s續約您的授權%2$s，以繼續使用透過 TranslatePress AI 提供的自動翻譯、進階附加元件、產品下載及自動更新服務。%3$s立即續約 %4$s','Error: '=>'錯誤： ','Something went wrong, please try again.'=>'發生錯誤，請再試一次。','Your <strong>TranslatePress</strong> license will expire on %1$s. Please %2$sRenew Your Licence%3$s to continue receiving access to automatic translations via TP AI, premium addons, product downloads and automatic updates. %4$sRenew Now%5$s'=>'您的 <strong>TranslatePress</strong> 授權將於 %1$s 到期。請 %2$s續約您的授權%3$s，以繼續使用透過 TP AI 提供的自動翻譯、進階附加元件、產品下載及自動更新服務。%4$s立即續約%5$s','Please %1$senter%2$s your license key to enable %3$s automatic translation.'=>'請 %1$s輸入%2$s 您的授權金鑰，以啟用 %3$s 自動翻譯。','%1$s automatic translation requires an active license. Please %2$srenew%3$s your license or purchase a new one %4$shere%5$s.'=>'%1$s 自動翻譯需要有效的授權。請 %2$s續約%3$s 您的授權，或 %4$s在此處%5$s 購買新的授權。','You have less than 5,000 TranslatePress AI words remaining. To continue automatically translating your website, please %spurchase additional AI words at a discount from your account%s.'=>'您的 TranslatePress AI 剩餘字數已不足 5,000。若要繼續自動翻譯您的網站，請 %s從您的帳號以折扣價購買額外的 AI 字數%s。','You do not have a valid license for <strong>TranslatePress</strong>. %1$sGet one for free%2$s to get access to TranslatePress AI.'=>'您沒有有效的 <strong>TranslatePress</strong> 授權。%1$s免費取得%2$s，以使用 TranslatePress AI。',' Error: '=>' 錯誤： ','<strong>NEW:</strong> The <strong>Different Domain per Language</strong> add-on is here! Boost your global SEO and create a local experience with country-specific domains like .de or .fr. <a href="https://translatepress.com/docs/addons/different-domain-per-language/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=new-addon-ddpl" target="_blank">Learn more</a>.'=>'<strong>新功能：</strong><strong>Different Domain per Language</strong> 附加元件已推出！提升您的全球 SEO，並使用 .de 或 .fr 等國家專屬域名打造在地化體驗。<a href="https://translatepress.com/docs/addons/different-domain-per-language/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=new-addon-ddpl" target="_blank">了解更多</a>。','<strong>NEW:</strong> The <strong>Different Domain per Language</strong> add-on is here! Boost your global SEO and create a local experience with country-specific domains like .de or .fr. Upgrade to <a href="https://translatepress.com/pricing/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=new-addon-ddpl-upsell" target="_blank">TranslatePress Business or Developer</a> to access it + more premium perks!'=>'<strong>新功能：</strong><strong>Different Domain per Language</strong> 附加元件已推出！提升您的全球 SEO，並使用 .de 或 .fr 等國家專屬域名打造在地化體驗。升級至 <a href="https://translatepress.com/pricing/?utm_source=wp-dashboard&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=new-addon-ddpl-upsell" target="_blank">TranslatePress Business 或 Developer</a> 即可使用，並享有更多進階權益！','The daily quota for machine translation characters exceeded. Please check the <strong>TranslatePress -> <a href="%s">Automatic Translation</a></strong> page for more information.'=>'機器翻譯字元的每日配額已超過。請查看 <strong>TranslatePress -> <a href="%s">自動翻譯</a></strong> 頁面以取得更多資訊。','Marketing optin'=>'行銷選擇加入','Opt in to our security and feature updates notifications, and non-sensitive diagnostic tracking.'=>'選擇加入我們的安全與功能更新通知，以及非敏感性的診斷追蹤。','TranslatePress Preferred User Language'=>'TranslatePress 使用者偏好語言','Preferred language to navigate the site'=>'用於瀏覽網站的偏好語言','The language is automatically set based by the last visited language by the user.'=>'語言會根據使用者上次造訪的語言自動設定。','Always use this language'=>'一律使用此語言','By checking this setting the preferred language will remain the one selected above, without the possibility of being changed in the frontend.<br>This language will be used in different operations such as sending email to the user.'=>'勾選此設定後，偏好語言將維持為上方選擇的語言，無法在前台變更。<br>此語言將用於不同操作，例如向使用者發送電子郵件。','Hello! Seems like you\'ve been using <strong>TranslatePress</strong> for a while now to translate your website. That\'s awesome! '=>'你好！看來你已經使用 <strong>TranslatePress</strong> 翻譯網站一段時間了。太棒了！ ','If you can spare a few moments to rate it on WordPress.org it would help us a lot (and boost my motivation).'=>'如果你能花幾分鐘在 WordPress.org 上評分，對我們會是很大的幫助（也能激勵我）。','~ Razvan, developer of TranslatePress'=>'~ Razvan，TranslatePress 開發者','Rate TranslatePress on WordPress.org plugin page'=>'在 WordPress.org 外掛頁面為 TranslatePress 評分','Ok, I will gladly help!'=>'好的，我很樂意幫忙！','No, thanks.'=>'不用了，謝謝。','Full Language Names'=>'完整語言名稱','Short Language Names'=>'簡短語言名稱','Flags with Full Language Names'=>'旗幟與完整語言名稱','Flags with Short Language Names'=>'旗幟與簡短語言名稱','Only Flags'=>'僅旗幟','Full Language Names No HTML'=>'完整語言名稱（無 HTML）','Bottom Right'=>'右下角','Bottom Left'=>'左下角','Top Right'=>'右上角','Top Left'=>'左上角','Dark'=>'深色','Light'=>'淺色','Install & Activate'=>'安裝並啟用','Invalid language code. Please try again.'=>'語言代碼無效。請再試一次。','Language codes can contain only A-Z a-z 0-9 - _ characters. Check your language codes in TranslatePress General Settings.'=>'語言代碼只能包含 A-Z a-z 0-9 - _ 字元。請在 TranslatePress 一般設定中檢查你的語言代碼。','Error! Duplicate URL slug values.'=>'錯誤！重複的 URL slug 值。','You cannot select two languages that have the same <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_ISO_639-1_codes" target="_blank">iso code</a> but different formalities because doing so will lead to duplicate <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions" target="_blank">hreflang tags</a>.'=>'你無法選擇兩個具有相同 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_ISO_639-1_codes" target="_blank">iso 代碼</a> 但不同正式程度的語言，因為這樣會導致重複的 <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions" target="_blank">hreflang 標籤</a>。','Duplicate language detected.<br>Each language can only be added once to ensure accurate translation management.<br> Please change the duplicate language entry and try again. '=>'偵測到重複的語言。<br>每種語言只能新增一次，以確保翻譯管理準確無誤。<br> 請變更重複的語言項目，然後再試一次。 ','Current Language'=>'目前語言','Opposite Language'=>'對應語言','Addons'=>'附加元件','Settings'=>'設定','Pro Features'=>'專業功能','Activate License'=>'啟用授權','Need Help?'=>'需要協助嗎？','Recent community discussions'=>'最近的社群討論','Loading...'=>'載入中...','Unable to load forum posts'=>'無法載入論壇文章','Ask a Question'=>'提出問題','View All Topics'=>'查看所有主題','by'=>'由','Have a question?'=>'有問題嗎？','Get help directly from the plugin developers, suggest improvements, or share your feedback!'=>'直接向外掛開發者尋求協助、提出改進建議，或分享你的意見回饋！','Tip for faster help:'=>'更快獲得協助的訣竅：','Include what you tried, what you expected, and what happened. Screenshots help!'=>'請包含您嘗試過的方法、預期的結果，以及實際發生的情況。截圖很有幫助！','Toggle support chat'=>'切換支援對話','Ask the community'=>'向社群發問','Close'=>'關閉','Empty feed response'=>'Feed 回應為空','Unable to parse feed'=>'無法解析 Feed','Just now'=>'剛剛','%d hour ago'=>'%d 小時前','%d day ago'=>'%d 天前','Source'=>'來源','Srcset'=>'Srcset','Alt attribute'=>'替代文字屬性','Title attribute'=>'標題屬性','Anchor link'=>'錨點連結','Placeholder attribute'=>'預留位置屬性','Submit attribute'=>'提交屬性','Text'=>'文字','Video Poster'=>'影片海報','plural form'=>'複數形式','one'=>'單數','few'=>'少數','many'=>'多數','other'=>'其他','Saved'=>'已儲存','Save'=>'儲存','Saving translation...'=>'儲存翻譯中……','You have unsaved changes!'=>'你有未儲存的變更！','Discard changes'=>'捨棄變更','Discard All'=>'全部捨棄','Loading Strings...'=>'正在載入字串...','Select string to translate...'=>'選取要翻譯的字串...','Close Editor'=>'關閉編輯器','From'=>'來源','To'=>'目標','Add Media'=>'新增媒體','Other languages'=>'其他語言','Context'=>'語境','View Website As'=>'檢視網站為','Available in our Pro Versions'=>'我們的專業版提供此功能','Select or Upload Media'=>'選取或上傳媒體','Use this media'=>'使用此媒體','Translate'=>'翻譯','Translate entire block element'=>'翻譯整個區塊元素','Split block to translate strings individually'=>'分割區塊以單獨翻譯字串','Save changes to translation. Shortcut: CTRL(⌘) + S'=>'儲存翻譯變更。快速鍵：CTRL(⌘) + S','Navigate to next string in dropdown list. Shortcut: CTRL(⌘) + ALT + Right Arrow'=>'導覽至下拉清單中的下一個字串。快速鍵：CTRL(⌘) + ALT + 向右鍵','Navigate to previous string in dropdown list. Shortcut: CTRL(⌘) + ALT + Left Arrow'=>'導覽至下拉清單中的上一個字串。快速鍵：CTRL(⌘) + ALT + 向左鍵','Discard all changes. Shortcut: CTRL(⌘) + ALT + Z'=>'捨棄所有變更。快速鍵：CTRL(⌘) + ALT + Z','Discard changes to this text box. To discard changes to all text boxes use shortcut: CTRL(⌘) + ALT + Z'=>'捨棄此文字方塊的變更。若要捨棄所有文字方塊的變更，請使用快速鍵：CTRL(⌘) + ALT + Z','Dismiss tooltip'=>'關閉工具提示','Quick Intro'=>'快速介紹','Are you sure you want to split this phrase into smaller parts?'=>'確定要將這個片語拆分成較小的部分嗎？','This string is not ready for translation yet. <br>Try again in a moment...'=>'這個字串尚未準備好進行翻譯。<br>請稍後再試...','For this option to work, please update the Browse as other role add-on to the latest version.'=>'若要使用此選項，請將 Browse as other role 附加元件更新至最新版本。','To translate slugs, please update the SEO Pack add-on to the latest version.'=>'若要翻譯 slug，請將 SEO Pack 附加元件更新至最新版本。','You can add a new language from <a href="%s">Settings->TranslatePress</a>'=>'您可以從<a href="%s">設定->TranslatePress</a>新增語言。','However, you can still use TranslatePress to <strong style="background: #f5fb9d;">modify gettext strings</strong> available in your page.'=>'不過，你仍然可以使用 TranslatePress 來<strong style="background: #f5fb9d;">修改頁面中可用的 Gettext 字串</strong>。','Strings that are user-created cannot be modified, only those from themes and plugins.'=>'使用者建立的字串無法修改，只有佈景主題和外掛程式中的字串才能修改。','Extra Translation Features'=>'額外翻譯功能','Support for 130+ Extra Languages'=>'支援 130 多種額外語言','Access to TranslatePress AI'=>'可使用 TranslatePress AI','Translate SEO Title, Description, Slug'=>'翻譯 SEO 標題、描述、Slug','Publish only when translation is complete'=>'翻譯完成後才發布','Translate by Browsing as User Role'=>'以使用者角色瀏覽並翻譯','Different Menu Items for each Language'=>'每種語言使用不同的選單項目','Upgrade to PRO'=>'升級至 PRO','Upgrade to PRO with our biggest discount of the year!'=>'以本年度最優惠的折扣升級至 PRO！','This Black Friday, get access to these features and more at a fraction of the costs:'=>'這個黑色星期五，以超值價格取得這些及更多功能：','No available suggestions'=>'沒有可用的建議','Suggestions from translation memory'=>'來自翻譯記憶庫的建議','Click to Copy'=>'點擊複製','Human Translation'=>'人工翻譯','Machine Translation'=>'機器翻譯','Gettext File Translation'=>'Gettext 檔案翻譯','Text on this page is %s% translated into all languages.'=>'此頁面的文字已有 %s% 翻譯為所有語言。','%1$s% of text on this page is translated into %2$s.'=>'此頁面有 %1$s% 的文字已翻譯為 %2$s。','This page is %1$s% translated into %2$s.'=>'此頁面已有 %1$s% 翻譯為 %2$s。','The slug that you are trying to edit is present in other slug types:%s%. Editing it will replace each occurrence, regardless of the current type.'=>'你正在嘗試編輯的 slug 也存在於其他 slug 類型：%s。無論目前類型為何，編輯後將取代每一個出現的位置。','Hover any text on the page, click %s,<br> then modify the translation in the sidebar.'=>'將滑鼠游標懸停在頁面上的任何文字，點擊 %s，<br>然後在側邊欄中修改翻譯。','Don\'t forget to Save Translation. Use keyboard shortcut CTRL(⌘) + S'=>'別忘了儲存翻譯。使用鍵盤快捷鍵 CTRL(⌘) + S','Switch language to see the translation changes directly on the page.'=>'切換語言即可直接在頁面上查看翻譯變更。','Search for any text in this page in the dropdown.'=>'在下拉選單中搜尋此頁面的任何文字。','Your %s license has <span class="trp-license-status-emphasized">expired</span>.'=>'您的 %s 授權已<span class="trp-license-status-emphasized">過期</span>。','<strong>This Black Friday, renew your license at a special price</strong> to continue receiving access to product downloads, automatic updates, and support.'=>'<strong>本週黑色星期五，以特惠價格續約您的授權</strong>，以繼續取得產品下載、自動更新及支援的存取權限。','Get Deal'=>'取得優惠','Please renew your license to continue receiving access to TranslatePress AI, premium addons, automatic updates and support.'=>'請續約您的授權，以繼續取得 TranslatePress AI、進階附加元件、自動更新及支援的存取權限。','Renew Now'=>'立即續約','Your %s license was <span class="trp-license-status-emphasized">refunded</span>.'=>'您的 %s 授權已<span class="trp-license-status-emphasized">退款</span>。','Please purchase a new license to continue receiving access to TranslatePress AI, premium addons, automatic updates and support.'=>'請購買新授權，以繼續取得 TranslatePress AI、進階附加元件、自動更新及支援的存取權限。','Purchase a new license'=>'購買新授權','Your %s license is <span class="trp-license-status-emphasized">missing or invalid</span>.'=>'您的 %s 授權<span class="trp-license-status-emphasized">遺失或無效</span>。','Please enter a valid license to get access to TranslatePress AI, premium addons, automatic updates and support. Need a license key? %1$sPurchase one now%2$s'=>'請輸入有效的授權以使用 TranslatePress AI、進階附加元件、自動更新及支援。需要授權金鑰嗎？%1$s立即購買%2$s','Enter a valid license'=>'輸入有效授權','Meta Information'=>'中繼資訊','String List'=>'字串清單','Gettext Strings'=>'Gettext 字串','Images'=>'圖片','Videos'=>'影片','Audios'=>'音訊','Dynamically Added Strings'=>'動態新增的字串','Translation Editor'=>'翻譯編輯器','Edit translations by visually selecting them on each site page'=>'在每個網站頁面上以視覺化選取方式編輯翻譯','String Translation'=>'字串翻譯','Edit url slug translations, plugins and theme translation (emails, forms etc.)'=>'編輯 URL slug 翻譯、外掛程式及佈景主題翻譯（電子郵件、表單等）','Current User'=>'目前使用者','Logged Out'=>'已登出','Translate Page'=>'翻譯頁面','Add a New Language'=>'新增語言','Your License is Invalid'=>'您的授權無效','Get More AI Words (%d left)'=>'取得更多 AI 字數（剩餘 %d）','Opens post in the translation editor. Post must be saved as draft or published beforehand.'=>'在翻譯編輯器中開啟文章。文章必須事先儲存為草稿或發佈。','Security check'=>'安全性檢查','<strong>Warning:</strong> Some strings have possibly incorrectly encoded characters. This may result in breaking the queries, rendering the page untranslated in live mode. Consider revising the following strings or their method of outputting.'=>'<strong>警告：</strong> 部分字串可能包含編碼不正確的字元。這可能導致查詢錯誤，使頁面在正式環境中無法顯示翻譯。請考慮修改以下字串或其輸出方式。','IMPORTANT: It is strongly recommended to first backup the database!'=>'重要：強烈建議先備份資料庫！','Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'確定要繼續嗎？','TranslatePress data update'=>'TranslatePress 資料更新','We need to update your translations database to the latest version.'=>'我們需要將您的翻譯資料庫更新至最新版本。','Updating will allow editing translations of localized text from plugins and theme. Existing translation will still work as expected.'=>'更新後即可編輯外掛和佈景主題本地化文字的翻譯。現有翻譯仍會正常運作。','Run the updater'=>'執行更新程式','Updating will allow editing translations of slugs. Existing translation will still work as expected.'=>'更新後將可編輯代稱的翻譯。現有的翻譯仍會正常運作。','Please activate the SEO Addon from <br/>WordPress -> Settings -> TranslatePress -> Addons section'=>'請從 <br/>WordPress -> 設定 -> TranslatePress -> 附加元件區段啟用 SEO 附加元件。','Go to Addons'=>'前往附加元件','The SEO Pack add-on allows translation of all the URL slugs:'=>'SEO Pack 附加元件可讓您翻譯所有 URL 代稱：','Taxonomy slugs'=>'分類法代稱','Term slugs'=>'詞彙代稱','Post slugs (this includes pages and custom post types)'=>'文章代稱（包含頁面和自訂文章類型）','Post type base slugs'=>'文章類型基底代稱','WooCommerce slugs'=>'WooCommerce 代稱','The SEO Pack add-on is available with ALL premium versions of the plugin.'=>'SEO Pack 附加元件適用於此外掛程式的所有進階版本。','Upgrade to Pro'=>'升級至專業版','Description'=>'描述','Article Section'=>'文章區段','Article Tag'=>'文章標籤','OG Title'=>'OG 標題','OG Site Name'=>'OG 網站名稱','OG Description'=>'OG 描述','OG Image Alt'=>'OG 圖片替代文字','Twitter Title'=>'Twitter 標題','Twitter Description'=>'Twitter 描述','Twitter Image Alt'=>'Twitter 圖片替代文字','Page Title'=>'頁面標題','Dublin Core Title'=>'Dublin Core 標題','Dublin Core Description'=>'Dublin Core 描述','OG Image'=>'OG 圖片','OG Image Secure URL'=>'OG 圖片安全 URL','Twitter Image'=>'Twitter 圖片','Removing cdata dictionary strings for language %s...'=>'正在移除語言 %s 的 CDATA 字典字串...','Removing untranslated dictionary links for language %s...'=>'正在移除語言 %s 的未翻譯字典連結...','Removing duplicated gettext strings for language %s...'=>'正在移除語言 %s 的重複 Gettext 字串...','Removing duplicated dictionary strings for language %s...'=>'正在移除語言 %s 的重複字典字串...','Removing untranslated dictionary strings where translation is available for language %s...'=>'正在移除語言 %s 中已有可用翻譯的未翻譯字典字串...','Inserting original strings for language %s...'=>'正在為語言 %s 插入原始字串...','Cleaning original strings table for language %s...'=>'正在清理語言 %s 的原始字串資料表...','Updating original string ids for language %s...'=>'正在更新語言 %s 的原始字串 ID...','Regenerating original meta table for language %s...'=>'正在重新產生語言 %s 的原始 meta 資料表...','Cleaning original meta table for language %s...'=>'正在清理語言 %s 的原始 meta 資料表...','Replacing original id NULL with value for language %s...'=>'正在將語言 %s 的原始 ID NULL 取代為值...','Inserting gettext original strings for language %s...'=>'正在為語言 %s 插入 Gettext 原始字串...','Cleaning gettext original strings table for language %s...'=>'正在清理語言 %s 的 Gettext 原始字串資料表...','Updating gettext original string ids for language %s...'=>'正在更新語言 %s 的 Gettext 原始字串 ID...','Starting gettext database optimization in the background...'=>'正在背景開始 Gettext 資料庫最佳化...','Migrating taxonomy and post type base slugs to new table structure...'=>'正在將分類法與文章類型基底代稱遷移至新的資料表結構...','Migrating post slugs to new table structure for language %s...'=>'正在將語言 %s 的文章代稱遷移至新的資料表結構...','Migrating term slugs to new table structure for language %s...'=>'正在將詞彙 slug 遷移至新資料表結構，語言為 %s...','Finishing up...'=>'正在完成...','TranslatePress needs to optimize gettext database tables. Translations continue to work while this runs in the background.'=>'TranslatePress 需要最佳化 Gettext 資料庫資料表。在背景執行期間，翻譯功能仍可繼續運作。','Before starting, we strongly recommend creating a database backup.'=>'開始之前，我們強烈建議先建立資料庫備份。','Start optimization'=>'開始最佳化','Update aborted! Could not schedule gettext database optimization.'=>'更新已中止！無法排程 Gettext 資料庫最佳化。','Database optimization did not complete successfully. We recommend restoring the original database or <a href="%s" >trying again.</a>'=>'資料庫最佳化未能成功完成。建議還原原始資料庫，或<a href="%s" >再試一次。</a>','Update aborted! Your user account doesn\'t have the capability to perform database updates.'=>'更新已中止！您的使用者帳號沒有執行資料庫更新的權限。','Update aborted! Invalid nonce.'=>'更新已中止！nonce 無效。','Back to TranslatePress Settings'=>'返回 TranslatePress 設定','Successfully updated database!'=>'資料庫更新成功！','Updating database to version %s+'=>'正在更新資料庫至版本 %s+','Processing table for language %s...'=>'正在處理語言 %s 的資料表...','Update aborted! Incorrect action.'=>'更新已中止！動作不正確。','Update aborted! Start the gettext database optimization separately from the Advanced settings page.'=>'更新已中止！請從進階設定頁面分別開始 Gettext 資料庫最佳化。','Update aborted! Incorrect language code.'=>'更新已中止！語言代碼不正確。',' done.'=>' 完成。','Update aborted while %1$s. SQL error: %2$s'=>'在%1$s時更新已中止。SQL 錯誤：%2$s','inserting original strings'=>'插入原始字串','checking original string insertion progress'=>'檢查原始字串插入進度','cleaning duplicate original strings'=>'清理重複的原始字串','updating original string IDs'=>'更新原始字串 ID','checking original string ID update progress'=>'檢查原始字串 ID 更新進度','inserting gettext original strings'=>'插入 Gettext 原始字串','checking gettext original insertion progress'=>'檢查 Gettext 原始字串插入進度','cleaning duplicate gettext original strings'=>'清理重複的 Gettext 原始字串','updating gettext original string IDs'=>'更新 Gettext 原始字串 ID','checking gettext original string ID update progress'=>'檢查 Gettext 原始字串 ID 更新進度','All individual TranslatePress add-on plugins <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">have been discontinued</a> and are now included in the premium Personal, Business and Developer versions of TranslatePress. Please log into your <a href="%2$s" target="_blank">account page</a>, download the new premium version and install it. Your individual addons settings will be ported over.'=>'所有獨立的 TranslatePress 附加元件外掛程式<a href="%1$s" target="_blank">已停止維護</a>，現已納入 TranslatePress 進階版個人版、商業版及開發者版本中。請登入您的<a href="%2$s" target="_blank">帳號頁面</a>，下載新的進階版本並安裝。您個別附加元件的設定將會被移轉過來。','Brand-new Language Switcher Settings are here!'=>'全新的語言切換器設定登場！','Explore pre-made templates