ar user role would. Really useful for dynamic content or hidden content that appears for particular users.'=>'如同特定使用者角色般瀏覽您的網站。對於動態內容或僅向特定使用者顯示的隱藏內容非常實用。','Navigation Based on Language'=>'依語言的導覽','Configure different menu items for different languages.'=>'為不同語言設定不同的選單項目。','Connect separate domains or subdomains to each of your translated versions. Strengthen your brand’s local identity and boost SEO performance for every language you support.'=>'為每個翻譯版本連接獨立的網域或子網域。強化品牌的在地識別度，並提升每種支援語言的 SEO 成效。','Enable Modules'=>'啟用模組','Enable Add-on modules to extend TranslatePress and enhance the functionality of your translated site.'=>'啟用附加模組來擴充 TranslatePress，並提升翻譯網站的功能。','TranslatePress Pro is active. Activate your license key to unlock the Pro add-ons below.'=>'TranslatePress Pro 已啟用。請啟用授權金鑰以解鎖下方的 Pro 附加元件。','Activate license'=>'啟用授權','TranslatePress Pro is installed but not activated yet.'=>'TranslatePress Pro 已安裝但尚未啟用。','Opens your Plugins page (filtered to TranslatePress) in a new tab. Activate the TranslatePress Pro plugin there, then return to this tab — it will update automatically.'=>'在新分頁中開啟你的外掛頁面（已篩選至 TranslatePress）。請在該處啟用 TranslatePress Pro 外掛，然後返回此分頁——它將自動更新。','Activate TranslatePress Pro ↗'=>'啟用 TranslatePress Pro ↗','More functionality with TranslatePress Pro.'=>'使用 TranslatePress Pro 獲得更多功能。','Upgrade now ↗'=>'立即升級 ↗','Already a Pro User?'=>'已經是 Pro 使用者了嗎？','Opens the WordPress “Add Plugins” page in a new tab. Upload and activate the TranslatePress Pro plugin there, then return to this tab — it will update automatically.'=>'在新分頁中開啟 WordPress「安裝外掛」頁面。請在該處上傳並啟用 TranslatePress Pro 外掛，然後返回此分頁——它將自動更新。','Install TranslatePress Pro'=>'安裝 TranslatePress Pro','This add-on is not available on your current plan.'=>'此附加模組在你目前的方案中無法使用。','Continue'=>'繼續','The link you followed has expired. Please reload the page and try again.'=>'你點擊的連結已過期。請重新載入頁面後再試一次。','Your license key is disabled for this URL. Re-enable it from <a target="_blank" href="https://translatepress.com/account