>'清除篩選條件','Language'=>'語言','Add New'=>'新增','Rescan plugins and theme for strings'=>'重新掃描外掛與佈景主題中的字串','Scanning plugins and theme for strings...'=>'正在掃描外掛與佈景主題中的字串...','Plugins and theme scan is complete'=>'外掛和佈景主題掃描已完成','Plugins and theme scan did not finish due to an error'=>'外掛和佈景主題掃描因錯誤而未能完成','Import / Export'=>'匯入 / 匯出','See More'=>'查看更多','See Less'=>'查看較少','Apply'=>'套用','No strings match your query.'=>'沒有符合查詢條件的字串。','Try to rescan plugins and theme for strings.'=>'請嘗試重新掃描外掛與佈景主題中的字串。','An error occurred while loading results. Most likely you were logged out. Reload page?'=>'載入結果時發生錯誤。你很可能已經登出。要重新載入頁面嗎？','found in translation'=>'在翻譯中找到','Select All'=>'全選','Select Visible'=>'選取可見項目','You are about to perform this action on all the strings matching your filter, not just the visibly checked. To perform the action only to the visible strings click "Select Visible" from the table header dropdown.'=>'您即將對所有符合篩選條件的字串執行此動作，而不僅是畫面上已勾選的字串。若只要對可見字串執行動作，請點擊表格標題下拉選單中的「選取可見項目」。','You are about to perform this action only on the visible strings. To perform the action on all the strings matching the filter click "Select All" from the table header dropdown.'=>'您即將只對可見字串執行此動作。若要對所有符合篩選條件的字串執行動作，請點擊表格標題下拉選單中的「全部選取」。','To continue please type the word:'=>'若要繼續，請輸入以下字詞：','The word typed was incorrect. Action was cancelled.'=>'輸入的字詞不正確。操作已取消。','Warning: This action cannot be undone. Deleting a string will remove its current translation. The original string will appear again in this interface after TranslatePress detects it. This action is NOT equivalent to excluding the string from being translated again.'=>'警告：此動作無法復原。刪除字串將會移除其目前的翻譯。原始字串將在 TranslatePress 偵測到後再次出現於此介面中。此動作不等同於排除該字串，使其不再被翻譯。','%d original entries and their translations were deleted.'=>'已刪除 %d 個原始項目及其翻譯。','Navigate to next page'=>'前往下一頁','Navigate to previous page'=>'前往上一頁','Navigate to first page'=>'前往第一頁','Navigate to last page'=>'前往最後一頁','Type a page number to navigate to'=>'輸入要前往的頁碼','Incorrect page number. Type a 