務。','TranslatePress is processing a background task.'=>'TranslatePress 正在處理背景任務。','TranslatePress background processing completed successfully.'=>'TranslatePress 背景處理已成功完成。','Processing %s...'=>'正在處理 %s...','%s is optimizing gettext database tables in the background. Translations continue to work while this runs.'=>'%s 正在背景中最佳化 gettext 資料庫資料表。在此程序執行期間，翻譯功能會持續運作。','TranslatePress gettext database optimization completed successfully.'=>'TranslatePress gettext 資料庫最佳化已成功完成。','TranslatePress has detected and cleaned up some failed translation entries in your database following %s. No further action is required.'=>'TranslatePress 在 %s 後偵測到並清理了資料庫中一些失敗的翻譯項目。無需採取進一步動作。','an isolated incident'=>'單一事件','Update aborted! Unknown gettext lookup hash migration phase: %s.'=>'更新已中止！未知的 gettext 查詢雜湊遷移階段：%s。','Update aborted! Could not find an available gettext original_id index name for table %s.'=>'更新已中止！無法找到資料表 %s 可用的 gettext original_id 索引名稱。','Update aborted! Gettext lookup hash migration cannot process invalid ID %1$d in table %2$s. Repair the table ID schema and retry.'=>'更新已中止！Gettext 查詢雜湊遷移無法處理資料表 %2$s 中的無效 ID %1$d。請修復資料表 ID 結構後重試。','Update aborted! Table %1$s still references %2$d duplicate gettext original ids.'=>'更新已中止！資料表 %1$s 仍參照了 %2$d 個重複的 gettext 原始 ID。','Update aborted! Gettext original meta still references %d duplicate original ids.'=>'更新已中止！Gettext 原始中繼資料仍參照了 %d 個重複的原始 ID。','Gettext database optimization completed.'=>'Gettext 資料庫最佳化已完成。','Deduplicating gettext translation tables...'=>'正在刪除 gettext 翻譯資料表中的重複項目...','Migrating gettext original lookup hashes...'=>'正在遷移 gettext 原始查詢雜湊...','Preparing the gettext originals lookup index...'=>'正在準備 Gettext 原始字串查詢索引...','Updating gettext runtime statuses...'=>'正在更新 Gettext 執行時狀態...','Finishing gettext database optimization...'=>'正在完成 Gettext 資料庫最佳化...','Updating gettext runtime statuses for language %s...'=>'正在更新語言 %s 的 Gettext 執行時狀態...','Resolving missing gettext original ids in %s...'=>'正在解析 %s 中缺少的 Gettext 原始字串 ID...','Preparing gettext table %s...'=>'正在準備 Gettext 資料表 %s...','Removing invalid gettext rows from %s...'=>'正在從 %s 移除無效的 Gettext 資料列...','Prepared gettext original ids in %s...'=>'已準備 %s 中的 Gettext 原始字串 ID...','Normalizing plural forms in %s...'=>'正在將 %s 中的複數形式標準化...','Processing duplicate gettext rows in %s...'=>'正在處理 %s 中的重複 Gettext 資料列...','Building duplicate gettext map for %s...'=>'正在為 %s 建立重複 Gettext 資料列對應表...','Verifying gettext table %s...'=>'正在驗證 Gettext 資料表 %s...','Deleting duplicate gettext rows from %s...'=>'正在從 %s 刪除重複 Gettext 資料列...','Rechecking duplicate gettext rows in %s...'=>'正在重新檢查 %s 中的重複 Gettext 資料列...','Adding unique gettext index for %s...'=>'正在為 %s 新增唯一的 Gettext 索引...','Finished gettext table %s.'=>'已完成 Gettext 資料表 %s。','License'=>'授權','Your License Key is valid.'=>'您的授權金鑰有效。','Your License Key is invalid.'=>'您的授權金鑰無效。','Your License has expired.'=>'您的授權已過期。','Deactivate License'=>'停用授權','Add a license key'=>'新增授權金鑰','License Key'=>'授權金鑰','Manage your license in your %1$s.'=>'在您的%1$s中管理您的授權。','Don’t have a TranslatePress AI License Key?'=>'沒有 TranslatePress AI 授權金鑰？','Get a free License Today'=>'立即取得免費授權','Add your License Key'=>'新增您的授權金鑰','Add your License Key to unlock all premium features. Find the License Key in your'=>'新增您的授權金鑰以解鎖所有進階功能。請在您的','Your license is valid and active.'=>'您的授權有效且已啟用。','TranslatePress License'=>'TranslatePress 授權','In order to enable Automatic Translation using TranslatePress AI, you need a license key by creating a free account.'=>'若要使用 TranslatePress AI 啟用自動翻譯，您需要建立免費帳戶以取得授權金鑰。','In order to enable Automatic Translation using TranslatePress AI, please enter your license key from'=>'如要使用 TranslatePress AI 啟用自動翻譯，請輸入你的授權金鑰，來自','Get Your Free TranslatePress AI License'=>'取得你的免費 TranslatePress AI 授權','Generate License'=>'產生授權','Get a Free AI License'=>'取得免費 AI 授權','This website is already activated under a free license. Each website can only use one free license.'=>'此網站已在免費授權下啟用。每個網站只能使用一個免費授權。','This website is already activated under a free license. Each website can only use one free license. Please upgrade to a premium plan for more TranslatePress AI words from %1$s your account %2$s.'=>'此網站已在免費授權下啟用。每個網站只能使用一個免費授權。請從 %1$s 您的帳號 %2$s 升級至進階方案，以取得更多 TranslatePress AI 字數。','Debug Data for License Checking'=>'授權檢查的偵錯資料','Debug Data for License Activation'=>'授權啟用的偵錯資料','Please install and activate the TranslatePress - Multilingual plugin'=>'請安裝並啟用 TranslatePress - Multilingual 外掛','Please update the TranslatePress - Multilingual plugin to version %1$s or higher to ensure %2$s functions correctly.'=>'請將 TranslatePress - Multilingual 外掛更新至版本 %1$s 或更高版本，以確保 %2$s 正常運作。','Please update TranslatePress - Multilingual to version %2$s or newer. Your currently installed version of TranslatePress - Multilingual is no longer compatible with the current version of %1$s.'=>'請將 TranslatePress - Multilingual 更新至版本 %2$s 或更新版本。您目前安裝的 TranslatePress - Multilingual 版本與目前 %1$s 版本不再相容。','All TranslatePress functionalities are disabled until then.'=>'在此之前，所有 TranslatePress 功能都將停用。','Update Now'=>'立即更新','This TranslatePress add-on has been migrated to the main plugin and is no longer used. You can delete it.'=>'此 TranslatePress 附加元件已移轉至主要外掛，不再使用。您可以將其刪除。','<strong>TranslatePress</strong> requires at least PHP version 5.6.20+ to run. It is the <a href="%s">minimum requirement of the latest WordPress version</a>. Please contact your server administrator to update your PHP version.'=>'<strong>TranslatePress</strong> 至少需要 PHP 5.6.20+ 版本才能執行。這是<a href="%s">最新 WordPress 版本的最低需求</a>。請聯絡您的伺服器管理員更新 PHP 版本。','TranslatePress Add-ons'=>'TranslatePress 附加元件','You must first purchase this version to have access to the addon %1$shere%2$s'=>'您必須先購買此版本才能存取附加元件 %1$s此處%2$s','You need an active license to have access to the addon. Renew or purchase a new one %1$shere%2$s.'=>'您需要有效的授權才能存取此附加元件。請%1$s在此處%2$s續約或購買新授權。','Please %1$senter your license%2$s key first, to activate this addon.'=>'請先%1$s輸入授權%2$s金鑰，以啟用此附加元件。','SEO Pack (Legacy)'=>'SEO Pack (舊版)','SEO support for page slug, page title, description and facebook and twitter social graph information. The HTML lang attribute is properly set.'=>'提供頁面 slug、頁面標題、描述以及 Facebook 和 Twitter 社交圖譜資訊的 SEO 支援。HTML lang 屬性已正確設定。','Recommended Plugins'=>'推薦外掛','A short list of plugins you can use to extend your website.'=>'簡短列出可用於擴充網站的外掛。','Profile Builder'=>'Profile Builder','Capture more user information on the registration form with the help of Profile Builder\'s custom user profile fields and/or add an Email Confirmation process to verify your customers accounts.'=>'透過 Profile Builder 的自訂使用者資料欄位，在註冊表單中收集更多使用者資訊，以及/或新增電子郵件確認流程來驗證客戶的帳號。','Paid Member Subscriptions'=>'Paid Member Subscriptions','Accept user payments, create subscription plans and restrict content on your membership site.'=>'接受使用者付款、建立訂閱方案，並在會員網站上限制內容存取。','WP Webhooks Automator'=>'WP Webhooks Automator','Create no-code automations and workflows on your WordPress site. Easily connect your plugins, sites and apps together.'=>'在 WordPress 網站上建立無程式碼自動化流程與工作流程。輕鬆串連你的外掛、網站與應用程式。','Save Changes'=>'儲存變更','Account Page'=>'帳號頁面','You can get one for %1$sfree%2$s, by creating a free account. It includes:'=>'只要建立免費帳號，即可%1$s免費%2$s取得一組。內容包括：','Debug Information'=>'偵錯資訊','Get more AI words and unlock all features with TranslatePress Pro.'=>'取得更多 AI 字數，並使用 TranslatePress Pro 解鎖所有功能。','Already purchased a Premium version?'=>'已購買進階版本了嗎？','Go to your %1$s'=>'前往您的 %1$s','TranslatePress.com Account'=>'TranslatePress.com 帳號','Download & Install the Pro plugin'=>'下載並安裝 Pro 外掛程式','Learn More'=>'了解更多','TranslatePress Errors'=>'TranslatePress 錯誤','There are no logged errors.'=>'目前沒有記錄的錯誤。','WordPress Translation Plugin'=>'WordPress 翻譯外掛','Back to Glossary'=>'返回詞彙表','Search Existing Translations'=>'搜尋現有翻譯','Search the existing dictionary entries to see how a term is currently translated in each language.'=>'搜尋現有的字典項目，查看詞彙目前在各語言中的翻譯。','To fully explore all the translations, use %s.'=>'若要完整瀏覽所有翻譯，請使用%s。','Search existing translations'=>'搜尋現有翻譯','Replace Existing Translations'=>'取代現有翻譯','The requested glossary term could not be found. It may have been deleted.'=>'找不到要求的詞彙表詞條。該詞條可能已被刪除。','&laquo; Back to Glossary'=>'&laquo; 返回詞彙表','For each language, enter the current (existing) translation you want to find; every case-insensitive occurrence in the stored translations will be replaced with the new translation, keeping the original capitalization.'=>'請為每種語言輸入您要尋找的目前（現有）翻譯；儲存翻譯中每個不區分大小寫的出現位置都會被取代為新翻譯，並保留原始的大小寫格式。','Leaving a language field empty will skip that language entirely (no changes will be made for it). Only one existing translation per language can be entered at a time. If you have multiple translations to replace for the same language, simply run the replacement again with the next value.'=>'將語言欄位留空會完全跳過該語言（不會進行任何變更）。每次每種語言只能輸入一個現有翻譯。如果您有同一語言的多個翻譯要取代，只需使用下一個值再次執行取代作業。','The "Existing translation" is not the term in the default language, but rather the already existing wrong translation you want to correct.'=>'「現有翻譯」並非預設語言中的詞彙，而是您想要修正的現有錯誤翻譯。','Existing translation'=>'現有翻譯','New translation'=>'新翻譯','Replace in existing translations'=>'在現有翻譯中取代','Glossary is available only with the TranslatePress AI engine.'=>'詞彙表功能僅適用於 TranslatePress AI 翻譯引擎。','Select the %s automatic translation engine to add and manage glossary terms. For other translation engines (such as DeepL or Google Translate), glossary functions are available in the translation provider’s dashboard.'=>'選擇 %s 自動翻譯引擎以新增及管理詞彙表詞條。對於其他翻譯引擎（例如 DeepL 或 Google Translate），詞彙表功能可在翻譯提供者的控制面板中使用。','Add Glossary Term'=>'新增詞彙表詞條','Define words or phrases that should not be translated automatically, and optionally provide replacements per language.'=>'定義不應自動翻譯的字詞或詞組，並可選擇為每種語言提供取代內容。','The original word or phrase in the default language.'=>'預設語言中的原始字詞或詞組。','Add Term'=>'新增詞條','Search glossary terms'=>'搜尋詞彙表詞條','Search terms'=>'搜尋詞條','Search Glossary'=>'搜尋詞彙表','Loading…'=>'載入中…','To edit existing translations, use the %s.'=>'如要編輯現有翻譯，請使用%s。','Language Switcher update notice'=>'語言切換器更新通知','Legacy language switcher is currently enabled'=>'目前已啟用舊版語言切換器','We’ve upgraded the switcher for richer customization and a better user experience.<br>In order to use the new configurator, turn off <strong>Load legacy language switcher</strong>.'=>'我們已升級切換器，提供更豐富的自訂選項和更好的使用者體驗。<br>如要使用新的設定工具，請關閉<strong>載入舊版語言切換器</strong>。','Note: You can switch back anytime from <strong>Advanced Settings → <a href="%s">Troubleshooting</a></strong>.'=>'注意：您可以隨時從<strong>進階設定 → <a href="%s">疑難排解</a></strong>切換回去。','Enable the new switcher'=>'啟用新切換器','Get a translation volume estimate with a detailed breakdown per page'=>'取得翻譯量預估，並提供每頁的詳細分項資料','Find how many translatable words are on your website'=>'查看您的網站上有多少可翻譯的字數','<strong>DeepL</strong> automatic translation is available as a <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" title="%2$s">%2$s</a>.'=>'<strong>DeepL</strong> 自動翻譯以 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" title="%2$s">%2$s</a> 的形式提供。','By upgrading you\'ll get access to all paid add-ons, premium support and help fund the future development of TranslatePress.'=>'升級後即可使用所有付費附加元件、獲得進階支援，並協助 TranslatePress 的未來開發。','To use <strong>DeepL</strong> for automatic translation, activate this Pro add-on from the <a href="%1$s" target="_self" title="%2$s">%2$s</a>.'=>'若要使用 <strong>DeepL</strong> 進行自動翻譯，請從 <a href="%1$s" target="_self" title="%2$s">%2$s</a> 啟用此 Pro 附加元件。','Please note that DeepL API usage is paid separately. See <a href="https://www.deepl.com/pro.html#developer">DeepL pricing information</a>.'=>'請注意，DeepL API 的使用需另外付費。請參閱 <a href="https://www.deepl.com/pro.html#developer">DeepL 定價資訊</a>。','TranslatePress Pro Add-ons'=>'TranslatePress Pro 附加元件','Test API credentials'=>'測試 API 憑證','Check if the selected translation engine is configured correctly.'=>'檢查所選的翻譯引擎是否設定正確。','Alternative Engines'=>'替代引擎','More info'=>'更多資訊','Switch to TranslatePress AI'=>'切換至 TranslatePress AI','Integrate machine translation directly with your WordPress website.'=>'直接將機器翻譯整合至您的 WordPress 網站。','Choose which engine you want to use in order to %1$s automatically translate your website.'=>'選擇您要使用的引擎，以便%1$s自動翻譯您的網站。','Automatically Translate Slugs'=>'自動翻譯 Slug','Generate automatic translations of slugs for posts, pages and Custom Post Types.<br/>The slugs will be automatically translated starting with the second refresh of each page.'=>'為文章、頁面和自訂文章類型自動產生 slug 翻譯。<br/>從每個頁面的第二次重新整理開始，slug 將會自動翻譯。','This feature is only available in the paid version. Upgrade TranslatePress and unlock more premium features.'=>'此功能僅於付費版本提供。升級 TranslatePress 以解鎖更多進階功能。','Requires <a href="%s" title="TranslatePress Add-on SEO Pack documentation" target="_blank">SEO Pack Add-on</a> to be installed and activated.'=>'需要安裝並啟用 <a href="%s" title="TranslatePress Add-on SEO Pack documentation" target="_blank">SEO Pack 附加元件</a>。','Automatic Translation Settings'=>'自動翻譯設定','AI Words Low Notification'=>'AI 字數不足通知','Receive an email notification when your TranslatePress AI word count drops below the specified threshold.'=>'當您的 TranslatePress AI 字數低於指定門檻時，接收電子郵件通知。','This feature is only available when using the TranslatePress AI translation engine.'=>'此功能僅在使用 TranslatePress AI 翻譯引擎時可用。','Notification Email'=>'通知電子郵件','The email address where the low AI words notification will be sent.'=>'接收 AI 字數不足通知的電子郵件地址。','Word Threshold'=>'字數門檻','words'=>'字','You will be notified when remaining AI words drop below this number.'=>'當剩餘 AI 字數低於此數字時，您將收到通知。','Block Crawlers'=>'封鎖爬蟲','Block crawlers from triggering automatic translations on your website.<br>This will not prevent crawlers from accessing this site\'s pages.'=>'防止爬蟲在您的網站上觸發自動翻譯。<br>這不會阻止爬蟲存取此網站的頁面。','Limit machine translation / characters per day'=>'限制機器翻譯 / 每日字元數','Add a limit to the number of automatically translated characters so you can better budget your project.'=>'為自動翻譯的字元數設定上限，以便更好地規劃專案預算。','characters per day'=>'每日字元數','Today\'s Character Count: '=>'今日字元數： ','Log machine translation queries.'=>'記錄機器翻譯查詢。','Only enable for testing purposes. Can impact performance.<br>All records are stored in the wp_trp_machine_translation_log database table. Use a plugin like <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-data-access/" target="_blank">WP Data Access</a> to browse the logs or directly from your database manager (PHPMyAdmin, etc.)'=>'僅供測試用途時啟用。可能會影響效能。<br>所有記錄都儲存在 wp_trp_machine_translation_log 資料庫資料表中。請使用如 <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-data-access/" target="_blank">WP Data Access</a> 之類的外掛來瀏覽記錄，或直接透過您的資料庫管理工具 (PHPMyAdmin 等) 查看。','Test API Credentials'=>'測試 API 憑證','HTTP Referrer: '=>'HTTP Referrer: ','Use this HTTP Referrer if the API lets you restrict key usage from its Dashboard.'=>'如果 API 可讓您從其控制台限制金鑰的使用範圍，請使用這個 HTTP Referrer。','Request URL'=>'要求 URL','Request Headers'=>'要求標頭','Request Body'=>'要求主體','Response'=>'回應','Response Body'=>'回應主體','Entire Response From wp_remote_get():'=>'wp_remote_get() 的完整回應：','Select the languages you wish to make your website available in.'=>'選取您希望網站支援的語言。','Formality'=>'正式程度','Code'=>'代碼','Formal'=>'正式','Informal'=>'非正式','This language does not support formality. '=>'這個語言不支援正式程度。 ','Are you sure you want to remove this language?'=>'您確定要移除此語言嗎？','Custom Languages'=>'自訂語言','Adding more than two languages is a paid feature. Upgrade TranslatePress and unlock more premium features.'=>'新增超過兩種語言是付費功能。升級 TranslatePress 以解鎖更多進階功能。','Please %1$senter your license%2$s key first to add more languages.'=>'請先%1$s輸入您的授權%2$s金鑰，才能新增更多語言。','You need an active license to add more languages. Verify in your %1$saccount%2$s that your license is valid'=>'您需要有效的授權才能新增更多語言。請在您的%1$s帳號%2$s中確認授權是否有效。','To Add more languages activate the Multiple Languages Addon'=>'若要新增更多語言，請啟用 Multiple Languages Addon。','Website Languages'=>'網站語言','WARNING. Changing the default language will invalidate existing translations.'=>'警告：變更預設語言將會使現有翻譯失效。','Even changing from en_US to en_GB, because they are treated as two different languages.'=>'即使是從 en_US 變更為 en_GB 也一樣，因為它們會被視為兩種不同的語言。','In most cases changing the default flag is all it is needed: '=>'在大多數情況下，變更預設旗幟就是所需的一切： ','replace the default flag'=>'取代預設旗幟','Re-run Setup Wizard'=>'重新執行設定精靈','The Setup wizard allows you to quickly setup TranslatePress. You can initiate it at any time.'=>'設定精靈可讓您快速設定 TranslatePress。您可以隨時啟動它。','Language Settings'=>'語言設定','Use Native language name'=>'使用語言原生名稱','Check if you want to display languages in their native names. Otherwise, languages will be displayed in English.'=>'如果您希望以各語言的母語名稱顯示，請勾選此項目。否則，語言將以英文顯示。','Use a subdirectory for the default language'=>'為預設語言使用子目錄','Check if you want to add the subdirectory in the URL for the default language.</br>By checking this option, the default language seen by website visitors will become the first one in the "All Languages" list.'=>'如果您想要為預設語言在網址中加入子目錄，請勾選此項目。</br>勾選此選項後，網站訪客看到的預設語言將會變成「所有語言」清單中的第一個語言。','Force language in custom links'=>'在自訂連結中強制使用語言','Select Yes if you want to force custom links without language encoding to keep the currently selected language.'=>'如果您希望強制沒有語言編碼的自訂連結保留目前選取的語言，請選取「是」。','Shortcode '=>'shortcode ','Use shortcode on any page or widget.'=>'在任何頁面或小工具使用 shortcode。','You can also add the <a href="%s" title="Language Switcher Block Documentation">Language Switcher Block</a> in the WP Gutenberg Editor.'=>'你也可以在 WP Gutenberg 編輯器中加入 <a href="%s" title="Language Switcher Block Documentation">語言切換區塊</a>。','Menu item'=>'選單項目','Go to  %1$s Appearance -> Menus%2$s to add languages to the Language Switcher in any menu.'=>'前往  %1$s 外觀 -> 選單%2$s，將語言加入任何選單的語言切換器。','Learn more in our documentation.'=>'在我們的文件中了解更多。','Floating language selection'=>'浮動語言選擇','Add a floating dropdown that follows the user on every page.'=>'新增一個浮動下拉選單，跟隨使用者瀏覽每個頁面。','Show "Powered by TranslatePress"'=>'顯示「Powered by TranslatePress」','Show the small "Powered by TranslatePress" label in the floater language switcher.'=>'在浮動語言切換器中顯示「Powered by TranslatePress」小標籤。','5 Days to Better Multilingual Websites'=>'5 天打造更優質的多語言網站','%sJoin our FREE & EXCLUSIVE onboarding course%s and learn how to grow your multilingual traffic, reach international markets, and save time & money while getting the most out of TranslatePress!'=>'%s加入我們免費且專屬的入門課程%s，學習如何提升多語言流量、觸及國際市場，並在充分運用 TranslatePress 的同時節省時間與金錢！','Invalid email address'=>'電子郵件地址無效','Your email'=>'你的電子郵件','Sign me up!'=>'我要訂閱！','Sign up with your email address and receive a 5-part email guide to help you maximize the power of TranslatePress.'=>'使用你的電子郵件地址訂閱，即可收到 5 部分的電子郵件指南，協助你充分發揮 TranslatePress 的功能。','Dismiss email course notification'=>'關閉電子郵件課程通知','Hey %s,<br>Never miss an important update - opt in to our security and feature updates notifications, and non-sensitive diagnostic tracking.'=>'嘿，%s，<br>別錯過任何重要更新——請選擇接收我們的安全性與功能更新通知，以及非敏感的診斷追蹤。','Allow & Continue'=>'允許並繼續','Skip'=>'略過','This will allow TranslatePress to:'=>'這將允許 TranslatePress：','Your profile overview'=>'你的個人資料概覽','Name and email address'=>'名稱與電子郵件地址','Admin Notices'=>'管理員通知','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'更新、公告、行銷，無垃圾郵件','Plugin status & settings'=>'外掛狀態與設定','Active, Deactivated, installed version and settings'=>'啟用、停用、已安裝版本與設定','Privacy Policy'=>'隱私權政策','Terms of Service'=>'服務條款','Support'=>'支援','Add Extra AI Words'=>'新增額外 AI 字數','<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> Before performing this action it is strongly recommended to first backup the database.'=>'<strong>重要注意事項：</strong>執行此操作前，強烈建議先備份資料庫。','IMPORTANT: It is strongly recommended to first backup the database!! Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'重要：強烈建議先備份資料庫！！確定要繼續嗎？','Operations to perform'=>'要執行的操作','Remove CDATA for original and dictionary strings'=>'移除原始字串和字典字串的 CDATA','Removes CDATA from trp_original_strings and trp_dictionary_* tables.<br>This type of content should not be detected by TranslatePress. It might have been introduced in the database in older versions of the plugin.'=>'從 trp_original_strings 與 trp_dictionary_* 資料表中移除 CDATA。<br>這類內容不應被 TranslatePress 偵測到。它可能是由舊版外掛引入資料庫的。','Remove untranslated links from dictionary tables'=>'從字典資料表中移除未翻譯的連結','Removes untranslated links and images from all trp_dictionary_* tables. These tables contain translations for user-inputted strings such as post content, post title, menus etc.'=>'從所有 trp_dictionary_* 資料表中移除未翻譯的連結和圖片。這些資料表包含使用者輸入字串的翻譯，例如文章內容、文章標題、選單等。','Remove duplicate rows for gettext strings'=>'移除 gettext 字串的重複資料列','Cleans up all trp_gettext_* tables of duplicate rows. These tables contain translations for themes and plugin strings.'=>'清除所有 trp_gettext_* 資料表中的重複資料列。這些資料表包含佈景主題和外掛字串的翻譯。','Remove duplicate rows for dictionary strings'=>'移除字典字串的重複資料列','Cleans up all trp_dictionary_* tables of duplicate rows. These tables contain translations for user-inputted strings such as post content, post title, menus etc.'=>'清除所有 trp_dictionary_* 資料表中的重複資料列。這些資料表包含使用者輸入字串的翻譯，例如文章內容、文章標題、選單等。','Remove duplicate rows for original dictionary strings'=>'移除原始字典字串的重複資料列','Cleans up all trp_original_strings table of duplicate rows. This table contains strings in the default language, without any translation.<br>The trp_original_meta table, which contains meta information that refers to the post parent’s ID, is also regenerated.<br>Such duplicates can appear in exceptional situations of unexpected behavior.'=>'清除 trp_original_strings 資料表中的所有重複資料列。此資料表包含預設語言的字串，不含任何翻譯。<br>trp_original_meta 資料表（包含參照上層文章 ID 的中繼資料）也會重新產生。<br>這類重複資料可能在發生未預期的異常行為時出現。','Replace gettext strings that have original ID NULL with the correct original IDs'=>'將原始 ID 為 NULL 的 gettext 字串替換為正確的原始 ID','Fixes an edge case issue where some gettext strings have the original ID incorrectly set to NULL, causing problems in the Translation Editor.<br>This operation corrects the original IDs in the trp_gettext_* tables.<br>Only check this option if you encountered an issue in the Translation Editor where clicking the green pencil did not bring up the gettext string for translation in the left sidebar.<br>Otherwise, please leave this option unchecked because it\'s an intensive operation.'=>'修正某些 gettext 字串的原始 ID 被錯誤設為 NULL 的邊緣案例問題，此問題會造成翻譯編輯器出現問題。<br>此操作會修正 trp_gettext_* 資料表中的原始 ID。<br>只有當您在翻譯編輯器中遇到點擊綠色鉛筆後，左側邊欄未顯示該 gettext 字串供翻譯的問題時，才勾選此選項。<br>否則，請勿勾選此選項，因為這是一項耗費資源的作業。','Optimize Database'=>'最佳化資料庫','TranslatePress Database Updater'=>'TranslatePress Database Updater','Updating TranslatePress tables. Please leave this window open.'=>'正在更新 TranslatePress 資料表。請保持此視窗開啟。','Open colour picker'=>'開啟色彩選擇器','Enabled'=>'已啟用','Disabled'=>'已停用','Write custom CSS here...'=>'在此撰寫自訂 CSS...','Include'=>'包含','Exclude'=>'排除','Content Restriction Mode'=>'內容限制模式','No languages selected'=>'未選取語言','Saving...'=>'儲存中…','Saved!'=>'已儲存！','Save changes'=>'儲存變更','Revert to last saved values'=>'還原為上次儲存的值','Revert changes'=>'還原變更','Restoring will revert to the last saved version and discard your current edits.'=>'還原將會回復至上次儲存的版本，並捨棄您目前的編輯內容。','Revert'=>'還原','Keep editing'=>'繼續編輯','Are you sure you want to apply the <strong>%s</strong> preset?'=>'確定要套用 <strong>%s</strong> 預設組合嗎？','It will override your current settings.'=>'這會覆寫您目前的設定。','Apply preset'=>'套用預設組合','Apply %s preset'=>'套用 %s 預設','Save failed'=>'儲存失敗','English'=>'英文','Spanish'=>'西班牙文','French'=>'法文','Minimal Light'=>'極簡淺色','Dark Overlay'=>'深色覆蓋','Brand Blue'=>'品牌藍','Bordered'=>'邊框','Popup Preview'=>'彈出視窗預覽','User Language Detection Method'=>'使用者語言偵測方式','Notification Behavior'=>'通知行為','Popup Content'=>'彈出視窗內容','Apply a preset'=>'套用預設','Customize Design'=>'自訂設計','Language detection'=>'語言偵測','Select how the language should be detected for first time visitors.<br>The visitor\'s last displayed language will be remembered through cookies.'=>'選擇首次訪客的語言偵測方式。<br>訪客最後顯示的語言將透過 Cookie 記住。','Popup display'=>'彈出視窗顯示','Conditionally display popup based on language'=>'根據語言條件顯示彈出視窗','Popup Type'=>'彈出視窗類型','Visitors will be redirected directly when a different preferred language is detected.'=>'當偵測到不同的偏好語言時，訪客將會被直接重新導向。','Popup Text'=>'彈出視窗文字','Button Text'=>'按鈕文字','Close Button Text'=>'關閉按鈕文字','Background color'=>'背景顏色','Text color'=>'文字顏色','Button background color'=>'按鈕背景顏色','Button hover color'=>'按鈕懸停顏色','Button text color'=>'按鈕文字顏色','Button border radius'=>'按鈕邊框圓角','Close icon color'=>'關閉圖示顏色','Overlay color'=>'遮罩顏色','Entrance animation'=>'進場動畫','Animation'=>'動畫','Fade'=>'淡入','Slide from top'=>'從頂部滑入','Slide from right'=>'從右側滑入','Slide from bottom'=>'從底部滑入','Slide from left'=>'從左側滑入','Enable custom CSS'=>'啟用自訂 CSS','No names'=>'無名稱','Show flags'=>'顯示國旗','Rectangle (4:3)'=>'矩形 (4:3)','Square (1:1)'=>'正方形 (1:1)','Flag border radius'=>'國旗圓角','Switcher background'=>'切換器背景','Switcher hover background'=>'切換器懸停背景','Switcher text'=>'切換器文字','Switcher hover text'=>'切換器懸停文字','Switcher border'=>'切換器邊框','Switcher border width'=>'切換器邊框寬度','Switcher border radius'=>'切換器邊框圓角','Hover over the language switcher to see it in action!'=>'將游標移至語言切換器上方，即可查看實際效果！','Switcher Preview'=>'切換器預覽','Enable Floating Switcher'=>'啟用浮動切換器','Switcher is enabled'=>'切換器已啟用','Switcher is disabled'=>'切換器已停用','Switcher Type'=>'切換器類型','Show languages as dropdown'=>'以下拉選單顯示語言','Show languages side by side'=>'並排顯示語言','Background hover color'=>'背景懸停顏色','Text hover color'=>'文字懸停顏色','Switcher border color'=>'切換器邊框顏色','Flag and text size'=>'旗幟與文字大小','Flag icons shape'=>'旗幟圖示形狀','Flag icons border radius'=>'旗幟圖示邊框圓角','Customize Layout'=>'自訂版面配置','Show the small Powered by TranslatePress label in the language switcher.'=>'在語言切換器中顯示小型的 Powered by TranslatePress 標籤。','You have unsaved changes. Leave anyway?'=>'您有未儲存的變更。確定要離開嗎？','Switcher animations'=>'切換器動畫','Transforms the language switcher into a button showing the other available language, not the current one. <br> Only works when there are exactly two languages, the default one and a translation one.'=>'將語言切換器轉換為顯示其他可用語言（而非目前語言）的按鈕。<br>僅在恰好有兩種語言時有效：預設語言和翻譯語言。','This option only works when exactly two languages are published.'=>'此選項僅在恰好發布兩種語言時有效。','Copied!'=>'已複製！','Copy'=>'複製','Use shortcode on any page or widget. You can also add the Language Switcher Block in the WP Gutenberg Editor.'=>'在任何頁面或小工具中使用 shortcode。您也可以在 WP Gutenberg 編輯器中加入語言切換器區塊。','Shortcode'=>'Shortcode','Additional Settings'=>'其他設定','Open the language switcher shortcode by clicking on it instead of hovering. <br> Close it by clicking on it, anywhere else on the screen or by pressing the escape key. <br> This will affect only the shortcode language switcher.'=>'透過點擊而非懸停來開啟語言切換器 shortcode。<br>透過點擊語言切換器、畫面其他位置或按下 Esc 鍵來關閉。<br>這只會影響 shortcode 語言切換器。','Menu Switcher Layout'=>'選單切換器版面配置','Go to <a href="/wp-admin/nav-menus.php">Appearance → Menus</a> to add languages to the Language Switcher in any menu.<br> <a href="https://translatepress.com/docs/settings/language-switcher/?utm_source=tp-language-switcher&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=ls-menu-item#menu-switcher" target="_blank">Learn more in our documentation.</a>'=>'前往<a href="/wp-admin/nav-menus.php">外觀 → 選單</a>，將語言加入任何選單中的語言切換器。<br> <a href="https://translatepress.com/docs/settings/language-switcher/?utm_source=tp-language-switcher&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=ls-menu-item#menu-switcher" target="_blank">在我們的文件中深入瞭解。</a>','Choose in which languages to show the block.'=>'選擇要在哪些語言中顯示此區塊。','Choose from which languages the block is excluded.'=>'選擇要從哪些語言中排除此區塊。','Select language(s)'=>'選擇語言','TranslatePress Language Restriction'=>'TranslatePress 語言限制','Language restrictions cannot be saved on a top-level Classic block. Convert it to blocks or place it inside a Group block first.'=>'語言限制無法儲存在頂層傳統區塊上。請先將其轉換為區塊，或將其放入群組區塊中。','page 1 of 3of'=>'/','Untranslated in this languagein'=>'在','Verbiage for the DeepL Pro Add-onAddons tab'=>'附加元件分頁','Verbiage for the DeepL Pro Add-onTranslatePress Pro Add-on'=>'TranslatePress Pro Add-on','block titleLanguage Switcher'=>'語言切換器','block descriptionDisplays the Language Switcher.'=>'顯示語言切換器。','block keywordLanguage Switcher'=>'語言切換器','block keywordTranslate'=>'翻譯','block keywordTranslatePress'=>'TranslatePress','block keywordLanguage Names'=>'語言名稱','block keywordFlags'=>'旗幟']];